{"sourceLanguage": "en","strings": {"Move, relative to tonight": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Move, relative to tonight"}}}},"Route and GPS distance, without the heart-rate and calorie summary": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Route and GPS distance, without the heart-rate and calorie summary"}}}},"Export Workout Route": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Export Workout Route"}}}},"Route Format": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Route Format"}}}},"Get the most recent recorded GPS route as a GPX or FIT file, ready to hand to Strava, Garmin Connect, or any other app.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Get the most recent recorded GPS route as a GPX or FIT file, ready to hand to Strava, Garmin Connect, or any other app."}}}},"NOOP has no recorded route with GPS measurements to export yet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP has no recorded route with GPS measurements to export yet."}}}},"Exported your most recent route.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Exported your most recent route."}}}},"Skips sessions that overlap a saved or imported workout, including workouts from Apple Health.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Skips sessions that overlap a saved or imported workout, including workouts from Apple Health."}}}},"Requires Live Sessions to be enabled in Settings.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Requires Live Sessions to be enabled in Settings."}}}},"Sleep result updated": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sleep result updated"}}}},"This night's sleep times or total asleep changed by at least five minutes.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "This night's sleep times or total asleep changed by at least five minutes."}}}},"Experimental · Oura ring all-day heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Oura ring only. Keeps your ring measuring heart rate through the day, standing it down only for your night. A WHOOP strap is not affected.": {"localizations": {}},"Oura ring: all-day heart rate & HRV": {"localizations": {}},"Your Oura ring only measures daytime heart rate while NOOP keeps it in that mode, and NOOP stops asking whenever the screen has been off for five minutes — which protects the ring's own sleep tracking at night, but also leaves a pocketed phone's day blank on the Heart Rate and HRV charts. On, NOOP keeps asking through the day and stops only for your usual night, learned from your sleep history (an hour before your typical bedtime to an hour after your usual wake), so the night is unchanged. Costs ring battery: the ring runs its own optical sensor all day. Until enough nights are learned it behaves as if off. Off by default.": {"localizations": {}},"Ring battery %lld percent": {"localizations": {}},"Ring battery %lld percent, charging": {"localizations": {}},"Oura notification mask ff (experimental)": {"localizations": {}},"Sends the official app’s SetNotification mask (1c 01 ff) instead of NOOP’s 3f at the next connect. The ring packs ~10 packets per notification for the official app and one for NOOP (9× slower drains); this is the first candidate switch. Off by default; the next connect after turning it off is back on 3f. Watch the strap log for “-> notify_all(ff)” and compare notification sizes in the raw capture.": {"localizations": {}},"Over-reports R-R, so no value is shown": {"localizations": {}},"7-day trend": {"localizations": {}},"Added to Today": {"localizations": {}},"Available": {"localizations": {}},"None added yet": {"localizations": {}},"Shown on Today": {"localizations": {}},"last night": {"localizations": {}},"no data yet": {"localizations": {}},"strap estimate (unverified)": {"localizations": {}},"toggle ON · no estimate yet": {"localizations": {}},"Pending sync · strap history still offloading": {"localizations": {}},"Strap battery charging, no reading yet": {"localizations": {}},"Strap battery, no reading yet": {"localizations": {}},"Strap battery, strap not connected": {"localizations": {}},"Strap battery %lld percent": {"localizations": {}},"Strap battery %lld percent, charging": {"localizations": {}},"Syncing strap history, chunk %lld": {"localizations": {}},"%lld cards shown": {"localizations": {}},"%lld added": {"localizations": {}},"%lld metrics shown": {"localizations": {}},"Looks like a workout around %@-%@ (avg HR %lld, %lld min). Save it?": {"localizations": {}},"Looks like a workout yesterday around %@-%@ (avg HR %lld, %lld min). Save it?": {"localizations": {}},"Looks like a workout on %@ around %@-%@ (avg HR %lld, %lld min). Save it?": {"localizations": {}},"I am not a WHOOP employee, contractor, or affiliate, and I am not using NOOP on WHOOP's behalf.": {"localizations": {}},"I own the WHOOP device I will use with NOOP and will only use it to access my own data. Doing so is my decision and my risk, including any effect on my WHOOP account, subscription, device, or warranty, and it may breach WHOOP's Terms of Service.": {"localizations": {}},"I understand NOOP is unofficial and experimental, is provided free and \"as is\" with no warranty, and is not a medical device or medical advice.": {"localizations": {}},"To the fullest extent the law allows, I will not hold the NOOP project or its contributors liable for any loss or damage arising from my use of it.": {"localizations": {}},"1m %lld": {"localizations": {}},"2m %lld": {"localizations": {}},"5m %lld": {"localizations": {}},"Close coach settings": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Close coach settings"}}}},"Coach settings": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach settings"}}}},"Connected, authenticating…": {"localizations": {}},"Connected, waiting for live heart rate.": {"localizations": {}},"Connecting to the ring…": {"localizations": {}},"Lift Log session": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate is flowing from the ring.": {"localizations": {}},"Live notifications": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP is connecting to your strap and will sync as soon as it's ready.": {"localizations": {}},"No heart rate stored for today yet": {"localizations": {}},"One five-minute block of heart rate today": {"localizations": {}},"Progress while NOOP pulls history from the strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Reconnect drops the current link, if any, and connects to the ring again. To pair or switch bands, open Devices.": {"localizations": {}},"Reconnect ring": {"localizations": {}},"Ring not connected.": {"localizations": {}},"Shown on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island. A switch only hides one: NOOP still measures and records everything.": {"localizations": {}},"Sync didn't start": {"localizations": {}},"Sync interrupted": {"localizations": {}},"Synced": {"localizations": {}},"Synced · %lld chunks": {"localizations": {}},"Syncing… %lld chunks": {"localizations": {}},"What the coach may read, how it is told to answer, and when it writes to you.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "What the coach may read, how it is told to answer, and when it writes to you."}}}},"3 weeks": {"localizations": {}},"sparse, widened to %@": {"localizations": {}},"30-day step average": {"localizations": {}},"Rolling average over the last 30 days": {"localizations": {}},"%lld of 30 days": {"localizations": {}},"Historical trend": {"localizations": {}},"bar": {"localizations": {}},"bars": {"localizations": {}},"week of %@": {"localizations": {}},"2W": {"localizations": {}},"3W": {"localizations": {}},"%lld daily %@ · %@": {"localizations": {}},"%lld weekly %@ · average per observed day · %@": {"localizations": {}},"%lld monthly %@ · average per observed day · %@": {"localizations": {}},"%@ steps": {"localizations": {}},"%@ average steps per observed day": {"localizations": {}},"Steps chart, no data": {"localizations": {}},"Steps chart, %lld daily %@, latest %lld steps, %@": {"localizations": {}},"Steps chart, %lld weekly %@, latest %lld average steps per observed day, %@": {"localizations": {}},"Steps chart, %lld monthly %@, latest %lld average steps per observed day, %@": {"localizations": {}},"1 observed day": {"localizations": {}},"%lld observed days": {"localizations": {}},"1 week · averages per observed day": {"localizations": {}},"%lld weeks · averages per observed day": {"localizations": {}},"1 month · averages per observed day": {"localizations": {}},"%lld months · averages per observed day": {"localizations": {}},"%lld working sets · compare when you repeat this program": {"localizations": {}},"%@ in sets": {"localizations": {}},"Holds the screen awake while NOOP pulls stored history from your strap, so you can watch a long sync finish without the phone locking. Only applies while a sync is running and NOOP is open. The screen sleeps normally the rest of the time. It uses a bit more battery while the screen stays on.": {"localizations": {}},"How NOOP behaves while it pulls stored history from your strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Keep screen on while syncing": {"localizations": {}},"Last 7 days · estimated": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP couldn't start the sync. Open NOOP to see the strap log.": {"localizations": {}},"Pull your WHOOP strap's stored history into NOOP now.": {"localizations": {}},"Stops the screen locking while your strap's history syncs": {"localizations": {}},"Sync Strap": {"localizations": {}},"Sync your strap, buzz it or mark a moment from Siri, Spotlight, the Shortcuts app, or a Back-Tap / automation. No setup needed.": {"localizations": {}},"Syncing your strap.": {"localizations": {}},"This session · estimated": {"localizations": {}},"Counted from the muscles you assigned each exercise: direct sets count once, indirect ones count as a half — the method the reference figures were derived under. An estimate from your own labels, not something measured off your body.": {"localizations": {}},"Counted from the muscles you assigned each exercise: direct sets count once, indirect ones half. The tick is about 4 sets a week — below that, studies across GROUPS of people stop reliably detecting growth. It is a research reference, not a target for you, and above it gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\".": {"localizations": {}},"%@ reps": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%@ reps"}}}},"%lld reps": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%lld reps"}}}},"%@ rest": {"localizations": {}},"%lld sets": {"localizations": {}},"Anything you want to remember": {"localizations": {}},"Build a program once, then tap through it at the gym. Kept on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Counted once per exercise": {"localizations": {}},"Details": {"localizations": {}},"Edit exercise": {"localizations": {}},"Edit program": {"localizations": {}},"Finish session": {"localizations": {}},"In order": {"localizations": {}},"In your words": {"localizations": {}},"Incline dumbbell press": {"localizations": {}},"Lift Log": {"localizations": {}},"No targets set": {"localizations": {}},"One number for the whole session, so a leg day can be compared with a run.": {"localizations": {}},"Reading your programs…": {"localizations": {}},"Rest (seconds)": {"localizations": {}},"Set done": {"localizations": {}},"Slow eccentric, pause at the bottom": {"localizations": {}},"Start first set": {"localizations": {}},"Start next set": {"localizations": {}},"Type any name you like. NOOP remembers it, with the muscles you give it.": {"localizations": {}},"Upper A": {"localizations": {}},"Warm-up": {"localizations": {}},"What you're aiming for": {"localizations": {}},"Working sets": {"localizations": {}},"The curve draws once the strap offloads, or once an import brings one in.": {"localizations": {}},"The curve needs two of them to draw a line.": {"localizations": {}},"While the strap is connected.": {"localizations": {}},"Your set, rest and heart rate, and the Lock Screen light-up on a double-tap.": {"localizations": {}},"Your strap is already syncing.": {"localizations": {}},"Your strap isn't connected to NOOP yet, so the sync didn't start.": {"localizations": {}},"Your targets for each exercise. What you actually lift is recorded when you run it.": {"localizations": {}},"measured from heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Chest": {"localizations": {}},"Front delts": {"localizations": {}},"Side delts": {"localizations": {}},"Rear delts": {"localizations": {}},"Triceps": {"localizations": {}},"Lats": {"localizations": {}},"Upper back": {"localizations": {}},"Traps": {"localizations": {}},"Biceps": {"localizations": {}},"Forearms": {"localizations": {}},"Quads": {"localizations": {}},"Hamstrings": {"localizations": {}},"Glutes": {"localizations": {}},"Adductors": {"localizations": {}},"Abductors": {"localizations": {}},"Calves": {"localizations": {}},"Abs": {"localizations": {}},"Obliques": {"localizations": {}},"Lower back": {"localizations": {}},"Neck": {"localizations": {}},"Push muscles": {"localizations": {}},"Pull muscles": {"localizations": {}},"Leg muscles": {"localizations": {}},"Trunk muscles": {"localizations": {}},"Add set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Add set"}}}},"Unfinished sets": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Unfinished sets"}}}},"Sets not started: %lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sets not started: %lld"}}}},"Complete them": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Complete them"}}}},"Discard them": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Discard them"}}}},"Every set would be a zero, so discarding saves no session and no workout.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Every set would be a zero, so discarding saves no session and no workout."}}}},"You changed the number of sets. Keep the new counts in the program for next time?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "You changed the number of sets. Keep the new counts in the program for next time?"}}}},"Pick one you have done before, or type a new name.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Pick one you have done before, or type a new name."}}}},"It joins this session with one set, its weight and reps at 0 until you type what you lift. Finishing asks whether the program keeps it.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "It joins this session with one set, its weight and reps at 0 until you type what you lift. Finishing asks whether the program keeps it."}}}},"Add to session": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Add to session"}}}},"You added exercises and changed the number of sets. Keep these changes in the program for next time?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "You added exercises and changed the number of sets. Keep these changes in the program for next time?"}}}},"You added exercises. Add them to the program for next time?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "You added exercises. Add them to the program for next time?"}}}},"New: %@ · sets: %lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "New: %@ · sets: %lld"}}}},"%@: %lld → %lld sets": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%@: %lld → %lld sets"}}}},"Update program": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Update program"}}}},"Keep as it was": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Keep as it was"}}}},"Choose an option above to save.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Choose an option above to save."}}}},"Edit sets": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Edit sets"}}}},"Save changes": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Save changes"}}}},"Completing saves them with the grey numbers shown. Discarding keeps them out of every figure; they stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in later.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Completing saves them with the grey numbers shown. Discarding keeps them out of every figure; they stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in later."}}}},"Fix numbers, or add and remove sets. Sets left at 0 reps stay out of the figures, and only this session changes — not the program.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fix numbers, or add and remove sets. Sets left at 0 reps stay out of the figures, and only this session changes — not the program."}}}},"No sets were performed. Discarded sets stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No sets were performed. Discarded sets stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in."}}}},"Max RPE (1–10)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max RPE (1–10)"}}}},"Max RPE must be between 1 and 10.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max RPE must be between 1 and 10."}}}},"Max RPE is a ceiling: the hardest a set should feel, where 10 means nothing left. It shows grey during the session, and a set you leave unrated saves it as its rating.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max RPE is a ceiling: the hardest a set should feel, where 10 means nothing left. It shows grey during the session, and a set you leave unrated saves it as its rating."}}}},"max RPE %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "max RPE %@"}}}},"Add a set to %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Add a set to %@"}}}},"Remove the last set from %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Remove the last set from %@"}}}},"The tick marks about 4 sets a week — the point below which the research doesn't reliably detect growth. Above it, gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\".": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "The tick marks about 4 sets a week — the point below which the research doesn't reliably detect growth. Above it, gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\"."}}}},"%@: %@ sets, at or above the weekly floor of %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%1$@: %2$@ sets, at or above the weekly floor of %3$@"}}}},"%@: %@ sets, below the weekly floor of %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%1$@: %2$@ sets, below the weekly floor of %3$@"}}}},"Discard session": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Discard session"}}}},"Discard this session?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Discard this session?"}}}},"Keep going": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Keep going"}}}},"%lld recorded sets will be thrown away. Nothing is saved and no workout is created.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%lld recorded sets will be thrown away. Nothing is saved and no workout is created."}}}},"%lld recorded sets will be removed, and so will the workout this session created. This cannot be undone.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%lld recorded sets will be removed, and so will the workout this session created. This cannot be undone."}}}},"That file is too big to be a program sheet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "That file is too big to be a program sheet."}}}},"Worth checking": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Worth checking"}}}},"%lld exercises": {"localizations": {"en": {"variations": {"plural": {"one": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%lld exercise"}},"other": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%lld exercises"}}}}}}},"Import a program": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Import a program"}}}},"Fill it in on a computer": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fill it in on a computer"}}}},"Download the template from the NOOP repository, fill in one row per exercise, then bring the file here. Excel, Numbers, Google Sheets and LibreOffice all work — .xlsx or .csv.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Download the template from the NOOP repository, fill in one row per exercise, then bring the file here. Excel, Numbers, Google Sheets and LibreOffice all work — .xlsx or .csv."}}}},"Only the exercise name is required. Anything you leave blank can be filled in later, or during the session.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Only the exercise name is required. Anything you leave blank can be filled in later, or during the session."}}}},"Choose a file": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Choose a file"}}}},"Choose a different file": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Choose a different file"}}}},"These lines still import — anything unclassified can be set in the app.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "These lines still import — anything unclassified can be set in the app."}}}},"That file could not be read.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "That file could not be read."}}}},"That does not look like a spreadsheet. Use the template, saved as .xlsx or .csv.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "That does not look like a spreadsheet. Use the template, saved as .xlsx or .csv."}}}},"That sheet has no Exercise column. Use the template — the import matches on the header names.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "That sheet has no Exercise column. Use the template — the import matches on the header names."}}}},"That sheet has no exercises in it yet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "That sheet has no exercises in it yet."}}}},"Set %lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Set %lld"}}}},"Heart rate %lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Heart rate %lld"}}}},"HR": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "HR"}}}},"A program is a name and an ordered list of exercises with your targets — working sets, reps, weight, rest and your own technique note.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "A program is a name and an ordered list of exercises with your targets — working sets, reps, weight, rest and your own technique note."}}}},"Set %lld — tap to mark it a warm-up": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Set %lld — tap to mark it a warm-up"}}}},"Warm-up set — tap to make it a working set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Warm-up set — tap to make it a working set"}}}},"Forget": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Forget"}}}},"Forget this exercise": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Forget this exercise"}}}},"Forget %@?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Forget %@?"}}}},"It stops being offered here. Sessions you already logged with it are kept exactly as they are.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "It stops being offered here. Sessions you already logged with it are kept exactly as they are."}}}},"You've saved the most exercises NOOP remembers": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "You've saved the most exercises NOOP remembers"}}}},"Forget one you no longer use and this one will save. Your logged sessions are never affected.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Forget one you no longer use and this one will save. Your logged sessions are never affected."}}}},"Set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Set"}}}},"Reps": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reps"}}}},"RPE": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "RPE"}}}},"Kg": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Kg"}}}},"Lb": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Lb"}}}},"Start this set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Start this set"}}}},"Redo this set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Redo this set"}}}},"Open the running session": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Open the running session"}}}},"How hard was the whole session? (1–10)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How hard was the whole session? (1–10)"}}}},"%lld of %lld sets done": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "%lld of %lld sets done"}}}},"Set %lld — working": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Set %lld — working"}}}},"Resting after set %lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Resting after set %lld"}}}},"Ready for the next set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Ready for the next set"}}}},"Next: Set %lld · %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Next: Set %lld · %@"}}}},"Last set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Last set"}}}},"No session running": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No session running"}}}},"All sets done": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "All sets done"}}}},"This set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "This set"}}}},"RPE %@ × %@ min": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "RPE %@ × %@ min"}}}},"Best set": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Best set"}}}},"Mean RPE": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Mean RPE"}}}},"How hard it felt": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How hard it felt"}}}},"Sets per muscle": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sets per muscle"}}}},"Session load": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Session load"}}}},"Work vs rest": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Work vs rest"}}}},"Figures": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Figures"}}}},"As performed": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "As performed"}}}},"Reading the session…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "trans