row’s %@ for you, based on %lld of your %@ days.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ higher on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on %4$lld of your %5$@ days."}}}},"A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ higher on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on typical patterns.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ higher on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on typical patterns."}}}},"A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ lower on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on %lld of your %@ days.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ lower on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on %4$lld of your %5$@ days."}}}},"A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ lower on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on typical patterns.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ lower on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on typical patterns."}}}},"A 60-second snapshot of your beat-to-beat (R-R) intervals from the strap, cleaned (range and ectopic-beat filtering) before computing RMSSD the same way your overnight HRV is computed.": {"localizations": {}},"A Shortcut wants to add %lld days and %lld workouts to the Apple Health import source.": {"localizations": {}},"A Shortcut wants to add data to the Apple Health import source.": {"localizations": {}},"A WHOOP export backfills recovery, strain, sleep and workouts. Apple Health can add HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂, steps, workouts and weight.": {"localizations": {}},"A WHOOP membership runs $300–480 a year, for life. NOOP does this for free: one person, no servers, no subscription.": {"localizations": {}},"A badge shows whether a number was scored on-device by NOOP, or imported from Whoop or Apple Health.": {"localizations": {}},"A baseline-normalized recovery score: your resting heart rate, sleep quality and night-to-night consistency, weighted against your own baseline, with heart-rate variability (rMSSD) leading wherever the strap gives us a clean reading.": {"localizations": {}},"A blend of how long you slept versus your personal need (the biggest factor), how efficiently (asleep versus in bed), how much was restorative (deep + REM sleep), and how consistent your sleep and wake timing is.": {"localizations": {}},"A bulk markers CSV import (date, marker, value, unit) lands with the file importers in Data Sources, same as nutrition and lifting. For now, add readings one at a time above. Everything you import stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"A buzz, not a banner": {"localizations": {}},"A calm evening reminder, timed from your wake time and usual sleep need. It's a suggestion, not an alarm.": {"localizations": {}},"A calm hour now helps you hit your wake time well-rested.": {"localizations": {}},"A cardiovascular load in the Banister TRIMP family: time spent in each heart-rate zone, weighted so harder zones count for more, summed into one daily figure.": {"localizations": {}},"A classic one-glance read of NOOP's own scores. Same data, different lens.": {"localizations": {}},"A clean, shareable one-page PDF of your recovery, sleep, HRV, resting heart rate and strain over a date range. Saved on your %@. Nothing leaves the device.": {"localizations": {}},"A couple of metrics depend on which Apple Watch you wear. Wrist temperature, which feeds skin temp, arrived with Series 8, so older watches don't report it. Blood oxygen is the bigger one: Apple removed the SpO₂ sensor from the newest US units over a patent dispute, so those simply don't measure it.": {"localizations": {}},"A couple of metrics depend on your model": {"localizations": {}},"A few honest words, so nothing's a surprise.": {"localizations": {}},"A few more days and we can show your Fitness Age.": {"localizations": {}},"A few more days and we can show your Vitality.": {"localizations": {}},"A few more days of wear, plus the basics below, and we can show your Fitness Age.": {"localizations": {}},"A few more nights of data and your readiness read will sharpen.": {"localizations": {}},"A few signals are up": {"localizations": {}},"A gentle wrist buzz when you've been sitting too long, a nudge to get up and move. Inferred from the strap's motion on each history sync, so it lags real time by a sync or two.": {"localizations": {}},"A logged caffeine is past your bedtime cutoff. It may still be on board and keep you up. Just a timing heads-up.": {"localizations": {}},"A lower resting heart rate usually means a higher charge.": {"localizations": {}},"A marker starts the selected phase and ends the previous one. This only timestamps the local capture file; it sends nothing to the strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Clear the R22 flags on your strap?": {"localizations": {}},"Clear flags on strap": {"localizations": {}},"Just stop sending": {"localizations": {}},"Turning this switch off only stops NOOP sending the unlock. The flags it already wrote stay on the strap until something clears them. NOOP can write the off value to all 16 now and read each one back so you can see what the strap actually stores. Needs the strap connected and bonded.": {"localizations": {}},"WHOOP 5/MG straps hand a fresh app only live heart rate. The official app switches on the deeper streams (high-rate HR + motion + history) by writing a set of feature flags, a sequence two independent projects have documented. With this on, the button below sends that exact sequence to your strap. Unlike everything else here it does write to the strap — and it is reversible: “Turn deep data back off” writes the off value to the same flags and then reads every one of them back, so you see what the strap actually stores rather than just that it acked. Experimental: it may do nothing on your firmware. iPhone/Android only. A Mac can't write to a 5/MG.": {"localizations": {}},"Strap accepted all %lld R22 flags": {"localizations": {}},"Strap accepted %lld/%lld R22 flags…": {"localizations": {}},"Clearing R22 flags and reading each one back…": {"localizations": {}},"Turning deep data back off needs an iPhone or Android. A Mac can't form the encrypted bond a 5/MG requires.": {"localizations": {}},"Needs the full encrypted bond: close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first (a live-HR-only link can't carry the write).": {"localizations": {}},"Writes the off value to all 16 flags and reads each one back, so you see what the strap stores rather than just that it acked. The off value is inferred from the flag NOOP already turns off this way for Garmin broadcast — it has never been seen on an R22 flag, so NOOP tries one flag first and stops if the strap refuses it. Clearing the flags is not the same as watching the deep records stop: check that by syncing afterwards.": {"localizations": {}},"A note on blood oxygen and your model": {"localizations": {}},"A once-a-day nudge when your Effort reaches the low end of today's optimal strain range, worked out from your recovery.": {"localizations": {}},"A period is likely between %@ and %@ (a window, not a fixed date).": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "A period is likely between %1$@ and %2$@, a window, not a fixed date."}}}},"A private notebook, not a medical service.": {"localizations": {}},"A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain, read straight from your strap, kept only on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain, read straight from your strap, kept only on this Mac."}}}},"A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain. Read straight from your strap, kept only on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"A quick word before we connect": {"localizations": {}},"A read-only Plews/Altini smallest-worthwhile-change reading of your nightly HRV: it shows whether your 7-night HRV baseline sits above, inside, or below your personal normal band. It changes nothing else - the Charge ring is identical whether this is on or off. This is rough / early testing, not yet validated against varying real data (n=1).": {"localizations": {}},"A read-only export of the decoded sensor streams NOOP already stores. Works on any strap. Nothing is written to your device, and nothing is uploaded.": {"localizations": {}},"A relaxation rhythm, not cardiac control. It never paces below a safe rate and you can stop anytime. If your heart rate doesn't settle, we'll say so plainly.": {"localizations": {}},"A reminder to recharge before bed when the strap drops to 15%, and a heads-up when it reaches 100%, each at most once per charge cycle.": {"localizations": {}},"A ring talks to one owner at a time.": {"localizations": {}},"A shareable one-page PDF of recovery, sleep, HRV, resting HR and strain over a range, saved on your %@.": {"localizations": {}},"A signature ring distils HRV, resting heart rate and sleep into one calm read on whether to push or rest.": {"localizations": {}},"A simple goal that adjusts to your effort. General wellness guidance, not medical advice.": {"localizations": {}},"A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device, your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device, your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app."}}}},"A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device: your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app.": {"localizations": {}},"A still, seated snapshot of your heart-rate variability": {"localizations": {}},"A sync is already in progress.": {"localizations": {}},"A transparent cardiorespiratory recipe that recovers deep and REM better than the default staging. Opt-in and experimental: it only changes how already-detected nights are split into stages (detection and scores are unchanged), and the default staging stays in place if you leave this off. Takes effect on the next nights staged.": {"localizations": {}},"A transparent cardiorespiratory recipe that recovers deep and REM better than the older V1 staging, and is now the default. It only changes how already-detected nights are split into stages (detection and scores are unchanged); turn it off to fall back to V1. Takes effect on the next nights staged.": {"localizations": {}},"A typical recent day": {"localizations": {}},"A watch samples your heart-rate variability rather than streaming it all night, so your Charge score needs roughly seven nights to calibrate. Until then NOOP shows “needs more data”, never a guessed number.": {"localizations": {}},"A weekly digest needs a few days of history. Wear your strap or import your WHOOP export in Data Sources.": {"localizations": {}},"A wellness estimate from your habits, not a clinical biological age.": {"localizations": {}},"ADVANCED": {"localizations": {}},"ALL": {"localizations": {}},"ALL TIME": {"localizations": {}},"ALL YOUR DATA · NONE OF THE CLOUD": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "ALL YOUR DATA · NONE OF THE CLOUD"}}}},"AM": {"localizations": {}},"API key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "API key"}}}},"API key (optional)": {"localizations": {}},"APPLE WATCH": {"localizations": {}},"AVG": {"localizations": {}},"AVG HR": {"localizations": {}},"AVG/SESS": {"localizations": {}},"About": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "About"}}}},"About %lld mg may still be active": {"localizations": {}},"About %lld min earlier than your schedule": {"localizations": {}},"About %lld min later than your schedule": {"localizations": {}},"About Apple Watch data": {"localizations": {}},"About Lab Book": {"localizations": {}},"About in sync with your schedule": {"localizations": {}},"About the same as your age": {"localizations": {}},"About this nap": {"localizations": {}},"About you": {"localizations": {}},"About your main sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Above band": {"localizations": {}},"Above your band.": {"localizations": {}},"Accept & Continue": {"localizations": {}},"Across the quiet windows we could read, your beat-to-beat timing held a tight, even shape.": {"localizations": {}},"Active": {"localizations": {}},"Active Energy": {"localizations": {}},"Active energy": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Active energy"}}}},"Active hours end": {"localizations": {}},"Active hours start": {"localizations": {}},"Active · Live": {"localizations": {}},"Activity": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Activity"}}}},"Activity & Energy": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Activity & Energy"}}}},"Activity Breakdown": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Activity Breakdown"}}}},"Activity Cost": {"localizations": {}},"Acts as a standard Bluetooth heart-rate strap. Pair NOOP from your treadmill, bike or app to see your strap's heart rate there.": {"localizations": {}},"Acute (7-day) vs chronic (28-day) training load. 0.8–1.3 is the sweet spot.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Acute (7-day) vs chronic (28-day) training load. 0.8–1.3 is the sweet spot."}}}},"Add": {"localizations": {}},"Add Workout": {"localizations": {}},"Add a custom marker": {"localizations": {}},"Add a custom question…": {"localizations": {}},"Add a device": {"localizations": {}},"Add a marker reading": {"localizations": {}},"Add a metric to compare": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Add a metric to compare"}}}},"Add a nap": {"localizations": {}},"Add a reading": {"localizations": {}},"Add a workout": {"localizations": {}},"Add metric": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Add metric"}}}},"Add nap": {"localizations": {}},"Added Cards": {"localizations": {}},"Add workout": {"localizations": {}},"Add your Oura app credentials to OuraSecrets.xcconfig to enable this.": {"localizations": {}},"Adds a fluid log and an effort-adjusted daily goal. Log a sip, cup or bottle to fill your progress ring. Data stays on this device.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Adds a fluid log and an effort-adjusted daily goal. Log a sip, cup or bottle to fill your progress ring. Data stays on this device."}}}},"Also imports water from Apple Health when connected and allowed to read water data. Drinks logged in NOOP are not written to Apple Health.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Also imports water from Apple Health when connected and allowed to read water data. Drinks logged in NOOP are not written to Apple Health."}}}},"Adds a water-log card to your dashboard": {"localizations": {}},"Adjust amount": {"localizations": {}},"Adjust manually": {"localizations": {}},"Adjust this session's details.": {"localizations": {}},"Advanced": {"localizations": {}},"Advanced HRV": {"localizations": {}},"Advanced. I already have my ring's key.": {"localizations": {}},"Advanced: I already have my ring's key": {"localizations": {}},"Advanced: use your own key": {"localizations": {}},"Aerobic": {"localizations": {}},"After a sync, NOOP looks over your recent heart rate for a sustained, raised stretch that looks like exercise and offers to save it. It only ever suggests. Nothing is saved until you tap Save, and you can dismiss any suggestion. Turning this off stops future suggestions but keeps your existing workout history. Deliberately conservative, so the odd workout may be missed. On %@ only.": {"localizations": {}},"After high-intensity effort": {"localizations": {}},"After tonight's sleep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "After tonight's sleep"}}}},"After your iPhone reboots, unlock it once. Until you do, iOS keeps NOOP's files locked (Data Protection), so new history can't be written or synced.": {"localizations": {}},"Age": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Age"}}}},"Age, %lld years": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Age, %lld years"}}}},"Alarms": {"localizations": {}},"Alcohol": {"localizations": {}},"Alert": {"localizations": {}},"Alerts": {"localizations": {}},"All": {"localizations": {}},"All Sessions": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "All Sessions"}}}},"All activities": {"localizations": {}},"All caught up": {"localizations": {}},"All history": {"localizations": {}},"All of this is computed on your own device from data you already have. No heartbeat data leaves it.": {"localizations": {}},"All stays on %@. Nothing is sent anywhere.": {"localizations": {}},"Allow Apple Health access": {"localizations": {}},"Allow access": {"localizations": {}},"Already clean.": {"localizations": {}},"Also share my patterns & Lab Book": {"localizations": {}},"Also share my patterns and Lab Book with the coach": {"localizations": {}},"Always rely on your doctor, pharmacist, or a qualified professional to interpret results and make decisions. If a number worries you, talk to them, not to an app.": {"localizations": {}},"Amount": {"localizations": {}},"Amount in mg (optional)": {"localizations": {}},"Amount in millilitres": {"localizations": {}},"An HRV reading needs the live R-R stream. Open the Live screen and connect your strap, then come back.": {"localizations": {}},"An estimated VO2max from the Nes / HUNT Fitness Study model (resting heart rate, age and activity), read against population norms to express it as a fitness age.": {"localizations": {}},"An experimental picture of your beat-to-beat heart timing. Not an ECG and not a diagnosis. You'll read and accept an experimental note before it shows anything.": {"localizations": {}},"An experimental picture of your beat-to-beat timing": {"localizations": {}},"An experimental picture of your beat-to-beat timing. Please read these first.": {"localizations": {}},"Analyse my sleep": {"localizations": {}},"And make sure it's charged.": {"localizations": {}},"Answers are about the night and day leading into this morning, the same attribution a WHOOP export uses, so logged and imported days line up.": {"localizations": {}},"Any OpenAI-compatible server: Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, or your own gateway. Stays on your network; nothing leaves %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Key header": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Key header"}}}},"Use Bearer for most local servers; use x-api-key for gateways that require the key in that header.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Use Bearer for most local servers; use x-api-key for gateways that require the key in that header."}}}},"Any amount helps. Thank you, genuinely.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Any amount helps. Thank you, genuinely."}}}},"Anything that needs Oura's cloud (web dashboard, Oura's coaching, shared circles).": {"localizations": {}},"Anything you see here (including any side-by-side trend) is your own information shown back to you. It's an association, never a cause, and never a medical finding.": {"localizations": {}},"App icon": {"localizations": {}},"Appearance": {"localizations": {}},"Apple": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Apple"}}}},"Apple Health": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Apple Health"}}}},"Apple Health (Live)": {"localizations": {}},"Apple Health isn't available on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Apple Health isn't available on this device, so there's nothing to connect here.": {"localizations": {}},"Apple Health lives on the iPhone, not the Mac, so connecting your Apple Watch happens there. Open NOOP on your iPhone, head to Settings, and run this same Apple Watch setup. Your scores then show up across your devices.": {"localizations": {}},"Apple Health sync failed: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Apple Watch. Needs more data to score this yet.": {"localizations": {}},"Apple's own sleep stages drive Rest directly. This is one of the watch's strengths.": {"localizations": {}},"Apple's sleep stages are strong, and they drive your Rest score directly.": {"localizations": {}},"Apple-logged": {"localizations": {}},"Apr": {"localizations": {}},"Armed on the strap with an experimental 5/MG command. Strap-driven wakes have been reported on 5.0 and MG, but are not guaranteed. Keep a backup alarm for anything you cannot miss.": {"localizations": {}},"Armed on the strap itself, so it can buzz at your wake time even if your phone is asleep or NOOP is closed. Sends the exact alarm command the official app sends, confirmed buzzing on a real WHOOP 4.0 (community wire capture + on-device test, #535). Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can't miss.": {"localizations": {}},"Armed on the strap itself, so it can buzz at your wake time even if your phone is asleep or NOOP is closed. We send the same alarm command the official app sends, but a strap-driven wake-up hasn't been confirmed on our side yet, so please keep a backup alarm for now.": {"localizations": {}},"Arms the strap to buzz at your wake time, even if NOOP is closed. Sends the exact alarm command the official app sends, confirmed buzzing on a real WHOOP 4.0 (community wire capture + on-device test, #535). Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can't miss.": {"localizations": {}},"Arms the strap to buzz at your wake time, even if NOOP is closed. Still experimental on WHOOP 4.0, so keep a backup alarm until you've confirmed it wakes you.": {"localizations": {}},"Arrange Today": {"localizations": {}},"Ask Coach about your data…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Ask Coach about your data…"}}}},"Ask about your charge, effort, rest and workouts, grounded in your own numbers.": {"localizations": {}},"Ask about your recovery, strain, sleep and workouts, grounded in your own numbers.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Ask about your recovery, strain, sleep and workouts, grounded in your own numbers."}}}},"Ask your first question": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Ask your first question"}}}},"Asks the strap for config VALUES: GET_DEVICE_CONFIG_VALUE (0x79) and GET_FF_VALUE (0x80), one key per round-trip. Both commands may simply not exist in this firmware — finding that out is the point. Read-only — no value is written, and the SET commands are never sent from this probe. The result is shown here and written to the strap log.": {"localizations": {}},"Asks the strap to list the feature-flag NAMES its own firmware knows: START_FF_KEY_EXCHANGE (0x75) then SEND_NEXT_FF (0x76) until the strap says it's done. Read-only — no flag value is written, and the SET commands are never sent from this probe. The list is shown here and written to the strap log.": {"localizations": {}},"Asleep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Asleep"}}}},"Asleep Time": {"localizations": {}},"Asleep avg": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Asleep avg"}}}},"Asleep duration": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Asleep duration"}}}},"At a glance": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "At a glance"}}}},"Attach this to a bug report.": {"localizations": {}},"Audio cues": {"localizations": {}},"Aug": {"localizations": {}},"Auto": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Auto"}}}},"Auto · %@ confidence": {"localizations": {}},"Auto · %lld bpm (Tanaka)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Auto · %lld bpm (Tanaka)"}}}},"Auto-detect workouts": {"localizations": {}},"Auto-nudge": {"localizations": {}},"Automatic": {"localizations": {}},"Automation": {"localizations": {}},"Automations": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Automations"}}}},"Autonomic balance (LF/HF)": {"localizations": {}},"Autonomic load": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Autonomic load"}}}},"Autonomic load from HRV and resting heart rate": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Autonomic load from HRV and resting heart rate"}}}},"Autonomic load through the day": {"localizations": {}},"Autonomic load today: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Autonomic rigidity from your heart-rate rhythm. Higher means a more rigid, stressed rhythm.": {"localizations": {}},"Average": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Average"}}}},"Average HR must be 25–250 bpm.": {"localizations": {}},"Average Heart Rate": {"localizations": {}},"Average heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Average heart rate in beats per minute, optional": {"localizations": {}},"Avg": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Avg"}}}},"Avg HR": {"localizations": {}},"Avg HR is shown as typed. The HR graph, zones and Effort stay from the recorded session.": {"localizations": {}},"Avg pace": {"localizations": {}},"Awaiting strap": {"localizations": {}},"Awake": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Awake"}}}},"BANISTER TRIMP / HR ZONES": {"localizations": {}},"BEAT-TO-BEAT": {"localizations": {}},"BEAT-TO-BEAT SCATTER": {"localizations": {}},"BEATS PER MINUTE": {"localizations": {}},"BEATS READ": {"localizations": {}},"BETA": {"localizations": {}},"BMI": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "BMI"}}}},"BPM": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "BPM"}}}},"Back": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Back"}}}},"Back to standard setup": {"localizations": {}},"Back to the marker list": {"localizations": {}},"Back up now": {"localizations": {}},"Backed up": {"localizations": {}},"Background Bluetooth has OS limits: iOS may pause NOOP when it's not in the foreground, so keep it open while syncing a fresh strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Backs up to your folder about once a day and keeps the latest %lld. On this platform it runs when you next open NOOP.": {"localizations": {}},"Backup & Sync": {"localizations": {}},"Backup & Sync to a folder…": {"localizations": {}},"Backup & restore": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Backup & restore"}}}},"Backup exported": {"localizations": {}},"Backup failed - re-pick the folder and try again.": {"localizations": {}},"Backup failed: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Backup folder": {"localizations": {}},"Backup imported": {"localizations": {}},"Backup problem": {"localizations": {}},"Backup wake: your smart alarm time is here.": {"localizations": {}},"Baevsky Stress Index": {"localizations": {}},"Balance": {"localizations": {}},"Balanced": {"localizations": {}},"Band": {"localizations": {}},"Based mostly on typical patterns, not yet yours. Log a few more %@ days and this becomes yours.": {"localizations": {}},"Baseline": {"localizations": {}},"Baselines are learned on-device over your first 14 days. Until then, typical ranges apply.": {"localizations": {}},"Battery": {"localizations": {}},"Battery %lld percent": {"localizations": {}},"Battery %lld%%": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Battery %lld%%"}}}},"Battery %lld%% · Charging": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Battery %lld%% · Charging"}}}},"Battery alerts": {"localizations": {}},"Battery pack %.1f%%": {"localizations": {}},"Battery voltage %.2f volts": {"localizations": {}},"Battery-info probe (#592 RE)": {"localizations": {}},"Battery-info probe (#592 RE)…": {"localizations": {}},"Battery-info probe result (#592)": {"localizations": {}},"Beat-to-beat timing varies for many ordinary reasons: breathing, movement, an imperfect optical reading, or the occasional extra or skipped beat that most healthy people have.": {"localizations": {}},"Beats": {"localizations": {}},"Beats per minute": {"localizations": {}},"Beats per minute across the session": {"localizations": {}},"Bedtime": {"localizations": {}},"Before you turn on Rhythm": {"localizations": {}},"Before you use NOOP": {"localizations": {}},"Behaviour": {"localizations": {}},"Behaviour Effects": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Behaviour Effects"}}}},"Below Zone 1": {"localizations": {}},"Below band": {"localizations": {}},"Below need": {"localizations": {}},"Below your band.": {"localizations": {}},"Beta": {"localizations": {}},"Beta feature": {"localizations": {}},"Beta. * is an on-device estimate. Skin temp is a trend versus your own baseline, and HRV needs you to be still. No Oura Readiness or SpO₂ percentage comes off the ring (import an Oura file for those).": {"localizations": {}},"Beta. * is an on-device estimate. Skin temp is a trend versus your own baseline, steps are a raw motion count, and HRV needs you to be still. No Oura Readiness or SpO2 percentage comes off the ring (import an Oura file for those).": {"localizations": {}},"Beta. Read this first.": {"localizations": {}},"Blood Oxygen": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Blood Oxygen"}}}},"Blood O₂": {"localizations": {}},"Blood oxygen": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Blood oxygen"}}}},"Blood oxygen (SpO2 %)": {"localizations": {}},"Blood oxygen (SpO₂)": {"localizations": {}},"Blood panel": {"localizations": {}},"Blood pressure": {"localizations": {}},"Body": {"localizations": {}},"Body Age": {"localizations": {}},"Body Age %lld": {"localizations": {}},"Body Composition": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Body Composition"}}}},"Body Fat": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Body Fat"}}}},"Body clock": {"localizations": {}},"Body fat": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Body fat"}}}},"Body-location probe (#690 RE)": {"localizations": {}},"Body-location probe (#690 RE)…": {"localizations": {}},"Body-location probe result (#690)": {"localizations": {}},"Bond your strap on the Live screen to feel the transitions hands-free.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Bond your strap on the Live screen to feel the transitions hands-free."}}}},"Bonded · streaming": {"localizations": {}},"Bonded, streaming.": {"localizations": {}},"Bonded. You're set.": {"localizations": {}},"Both NOOP and the Oura app can use a ring you own by key, but only one can hold the Bluetooth link at a time.": {"localizations": {}},"Bottle": {"localizations": {}},"Bounce back": {"localizations": {}},"Box": {"localizations": {}},"Box 4-4": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Breathe"}}}},"Breathe at the pace your last “find my pace” sweep locked in, if you have one. Otherwise a calm 5.5 breaths/min.": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe in": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe in for %lld seconds": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe in…": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe mode": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe now": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe out": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe out for %lld seconds": {"localizations": {}},"Breathe out…": {"localizations": {}},"Breaths per minute": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Breaths per minute"}}}},"Bring in a markers CSV (date, marker, value, unit). Names that match the catalog fold onto your existing markers; anything else comes in as a custom marker. Rows that can't be read are skipped and counted, never guessed. Everything you import stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Bring your history": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcast HR from this phone": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcast HR is ON. Your strap is advertising its heart rate continuously, which keeps its radio hot and drains the battery faster. Turn it off when you're not using it with another device.": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcast heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcast heart rate (Garmin/ANT)": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcast heart rate as a Bluetooth sensor": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcast strap HR (Garmin/ANT)": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcasting": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcasts the live heart rate NOOP derives from the strap once connected.": {"localizations": {}},"Broadcasts the strap's own live heart rate over Bluetooth.": {"localizations": {}},"Bug report": {"localizations": {}},"Build your own": {"localizations": {}},"Building": {"localizations": {}},"Building (1 window)": {"localizations": {}},"Building from your strap": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Building from your strap"}}}},"Building your baseline": {"localizations": {}},"Building your baseline. About %lld more %@ until your scores are personal.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Building your baseline. About %1$lld more %2$@ until your scores are personal."}}}},"Building your baseline. About %lld more nights until your scores are personal.": {"localizations": {}},"Building your baseline. About 1 more night until your scores are personal.": {"localizations": {}},"Building your best-sourced record…": {"localizations": {}},"Building, moves as you do": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Building, moves as you do"}}}},"Building, wear it tonight": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Building, wear it tonight"}}}},"Building. Keep logging.": {"localizations": {}},"Builds a redacted .zip, shows you exactly what it contains, then opens a prefilled GitHub issue. You attach the file on the next screen.": {"localizations": {}},"Built from Apple's cardio-fitness VO₂ max estimate, the same number the Fitness app shows.": {"localizations": {}},"Built from published methods (Nes/HUNT) on %@. It's a fitness comparison against an average peer your age, not a biological or medical age.": {"localizations": {}},"Built from the watch's cardio-fitness VO₂ max, the same number the Fitness app shows.": {"localizations": {}},"Built on": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Built on"}}}},"Buzz Strap": {"localizations": {}},"Buzz back (confirm)": {"localizations": {}},"Buzz cues on": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Buzz cues on"}}}},"Buzz strap": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Buzz strap"}}}},"Buzz strength": {"localizations": {}},"Buzz the time": {"localizations": {}},"Buzz when you hit your top zone (ease off) and again when you recover. Uses your max HR from Settings.": {"localizations": {}},"Buzz your strap when these apps notify you. Everything runs on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Buzz your strap when these apps notify you. Everything runs on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Buzz your strap when these apps notify you. Everything runs on this Mac."}}}},"Buzzes after you've been sitting past your threshold.": {"localizations": {}},"Buzzes your wrist": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Buzzes your wrist"}}}},"By Day": {"localizations": {}},"By sport": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "By sport"}}}},"By the numbers": {"localizations": {}},"CADENCE": {"localizations": {}},"CALIBRATING": {"localizations": {}},"CLOUD SHAPE": {"localizations": {}},"COMPLETE": {"localizations": {}},"CONNECTED": {"localizations": {}},"CONNECTING": {"localizations": {}},"CONTROL CENTER": {"localizations": {}},"CSV exported": {"localizations": {}},"Caffeine": {"localizations": {}},"Caffeine may still be active": {"localizations": {}},"Calendar": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Calendar"}}}},"Calibrate steps estimate": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrate the steps estimate": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrate your steps": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrating": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Calibrating"}}}},"Calibrating (%lld of %lld)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Calibrating, %1$lld of %2$lld"}}}},"Calibrating (%lld/%lld nights)": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrating, %lld of %lld": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Calibrating, %lld of %lld"}}}},"Calibrating, %lld of %lld nights": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Calibrating, %1$lld of %2$lld nights"}}}},"Calibrating, no data yet": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrating, no heart rate banked yet today": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrating. Building your baseline. About %lld more nights until your scores are personal.": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrating. Building your baseline. About 1 more night until your scores are personal.": {"localizations": {}},"Calibrating. Too thin to read yet.": {"localizations": {}},"Calibration": {"localizations": {}},"Calm": {"localizations": {}},"Calm me": {"localizations": {}},"Calm me · 3 min": {"localizations": {}},"Calm time": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Calm time"}}}},"Calories": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Calories"}}}},"Calories In": {"localizations": {}},"Calories in kilocalories, optional": {"localizations": {}},"Calories must be 0–20,000.": {"localizations": {}},"Can't connect: your strap's pairing was reset": {"localizations": {}},"Cancel": {"localizations": {}},"Capturing": {"localizations": {}},"Capturing. %lld seconds remaining, %lld beats collected.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Capturing. %1$lld seconds remaining, %2$lld beats collected."}}}},"Carried · %@": {"localizations": {}},"Carbs": {"localizations": {}},"Card transparency": {"localizations": {}},"Cardiac": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Cardiac"}}}},"Cardiovascular load for the day, on a 0–100 scale (was 0–21).": {"localizations": {}},"Category": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Category"}}}},"Change": {"localizations": {}},"Change folder": {"localizations": {}},"Change marker": {"localizations": {}},"Change photo": {"localizations": {}},"Change to Number": {"localizations": {}},"Change to Yes/No": {"localizations": {}},"Changes the Bluetooth name your WHOOP 4.0 advertises (what you see when pairing). The strap reboots to apply, so the new name appears the next time it connects. WHOOP 4.0 only.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Charge"}}}},"Charge %@%%": {"localizations": {}},"Charge %lld today, so your band is %lld–%lld bpm.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge (all history)": {"localizations": {}},"Charge (past year)": {"localizations": {}},"Charge baseline calibrating. %@, %@. %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Charge baseline calibrating. %1$@, %2$@. %3$@."}}}},"Charge baseline recalibrating": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is low and sleep was consistent.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is low but sleep ran short.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is low.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is steady and sleep was consistent.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is steady but sleep ran short.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is steady.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is strong and sleep was consistent.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is strong but sleep ran short.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge is strong.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge model": {"localizations": {}},"Charge scale, depleted to peaked": {"localizations": {}},"Charge trend": {"localizations": {}},"Charge weighs your HRV against your personal baseline (~55%%), resting heart rate (~20%%), rest quality (~15%%), respiration (~5%%) and skin-temperature deviation (~5%%). Effort is a 0-%lld cardiovascular load from time in heart-rate zones. Rest is staged from movement and heart rate. Everything is computed here from the strap's raw data. It works for any day NOOP collected raw streams.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge weighs your HRV against your personal baseline (~55%%), resting heart rate (~20%%), rest quality (~15%%), respiration (~5%%) and skin-temperature deviation (~5%%). Effort is a 0–%@ cardiovascular load from time in heart-rate zones. Rest is staged from movement and heart rate. Everything is computed here from the strap's raw data. It works for any day NOOP collected raw streams.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge your WHOOP now": {"localizations": {}},"Charge · %@ pts": {"localizations": {}},"Charge · Effort · Rest": {"localizations": {}},"Charge → Next-day charge": {"localizations": {}},"Charge, Effort and Rest (and how they differ from WHOOP).": {"localizations": {}},"Charge, Effort and Rest are scored on your own device from your strap data. Charge needs about four nights of sleep to learn your baseline (that's \"Calibrating\", counted as nights of 4 on the ring), and keeps sharpening over your first couple of weeks. On a WHOOP 5 or MG the strap banks little history, so that count can sit at 0 of 4 until you have worn it across a few nights. That's the strap's sync limit, not a fault. Before there's a number, NOOP shows what it can without faking one.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge, Effort and Rest become personal after a few nights of wear.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge, Effort and Rest build over your next few nights of wear.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge, Effort, Rest, HRV, resting and live heart rate, and strap battery at a glance.": {"localizations": {}},"Charge: how recovered are you?": {"localizations": {}},"Charging": {"localizations": {}},"Chart colours": {"localizations": {}},"Check for updates": {"localizations": {}},"Check the values and try again.": {"localizations": {}},"Checking…": {"localizations": {}},"Checks the project's home (GitHub) for the latest version when you tap. Nothing else is sent.": {"localizations": {}},"Choose": {"localizations": {}},"Choose .csv…": {"localizations": {}},"Choose .gpx / .tcx / .fit…": {"localizations": {}},"Choose Light, Dark, or follow your system. Dark is the signature near-black; Light keeps the same clean look on a bright canvas.": {"localizations": {}},"Choose Mi Fitness export…": {"localizations": {}},"Choose a backup": {"localizations": {}},"Choose a folder for NOOP backups (for example a Google Drive or iCloud folder).": {"localizations": {}},"Choose a wearable signal to compare": {"localizations": {}},"Choose export.zip…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Choose export.zip…"}}}},"Choose export…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Choose export…"}}}},"Choose folder": {"localizations": {}},"Choose how NOOP looks. The whole app updates as you tap. You can change this any time in Settings → Appearance.": {"localizations": {}},"Choose how distances, weights, heights, temperatures and Effort are shown. Your data is always stored the same way. This only changes the display.": {"localizations": {}},"Choose photo": {"localizations": {}},"Choose the buzz pattern for %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Choose the buzz pattern for %@"}}}},"Choose which Key Metrics show and reorder them": {"localizations": {}},"Choose which cards show and reorder them": {"localizations": {}},"Choose which tiles show on your Control Center and reorder them with the arrows.": {"localizations": {}},"Clean up": {"localizations": {}},"Clean up leftover import files": {"localizations": {}},"Clean up now": {"localizations": {}},"Cleaning up…": {"localizations": {}},"Clear": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Clear"}}}},"Clear %@ override, use the default wake time": {"localizations": {}},"Clear all": {"localizations": {}},"Clear scheduled exports": {"localizations": {}},"Clear scheduled exports?": {"localizations": {}},"Close": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Close"}}}},"Close HRV reading": {"localizations": {}},"Close Rhythm": {"localizations": {}},"Close Support": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Close Support"}}}},"Coach": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach"}}}},"Coach instructions": {"localizations": {}},"Coach instructions editor": {"localizations": {}},"Coach is thinking": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach is thinking"}}}},"Coach is thinking…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach is thinking…"}}}},"Coach reads a summary of your last two weeks plus 30-day averages and recent workouts, then answers in plain language. Try a suggestion below.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach reads a summary of your last two weeks plus 30-day averages and recent workouts, then answers in plain language. Try a suggestion below."}}}},"Coach said: %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach said: %@"}}}},"Coach talks only to the server URL you set. Point it at a local model (Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp) to keep everything on your own machine. Nothing is sent until you ask.": {"localizations": {}},"Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the Keychain and never leaves %@ except as the request you make.": {"localizations": {}},"Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the macOS Keychain and never leaves your Mac except as the request you make.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the macOS Keychain and never leaves your Mac except as the request you make."}}}},"Coherence": {"localizations": {}},"Coherence 5.5": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coherence 5.5"}}}},"Coherence estimate": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coherence estimate"}}}},"Coherent": {"localizations": {}},"Collapse": {"localizations": {}},"Collapse coach instructions": {"localizations": {}},"Collapsed": {"localizations": {}},"Collect a few logged intervention days before reading the effect. Baseline and imported metrics stay in place.": {"localizations": {}},"Coming soon": {"localizations": {}},"Coming together": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Coming together"}}}},"Compare": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Compare"}}}},"Compare needs at least two metrics with history. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources first.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Compare needs at least two metrics with history. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources first."}}}},"Compare sources": {"localizations": {}},"Compare with a signal": {"localizations": {}},"Complete": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Complete"}}}},"Compliance": {"localizations": {}},"Computed live from your Apple Watch via Health. Recovery needs about a week of nights to calibrate, and every watch-derived score is labelled with its confidence. Only the metrics your watch actually records are listed above.": {"localizations": {}},"Confidence": {"localizations": {}},"Confidence: %@ (distance %@)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Confidence: %1$@ (distance %2$@)"}}}},"Confidence: calibrating": {"localizations": {}},"Confidence: estimate": {"localizations": {}},"Confidence: reliable": {"localizations": {}},"Configure": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Configure"}}}},"Connect": {"localizations": {}},"Connect Apple Health": {"localizations": {}},"Connect a WHOOP, a heart-rate strap or a gym machine and watch each beat in real time: heart rate, variability and zones as they happen. Already have history elsewhere? Import it from WHOOP, Apple Health, Oura, Fitbit or Garmin.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect a provider": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connect a provider"}}}},"Connect strap for buzz cues": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connect strap for buzz cues"}}}},"Connect the strap first, then mark a workout from the live stream.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect to read wear state": {"localizations": {}},"Connect to this ring": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your WHOOP strap in NOOP, then try again.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap first.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap first. The reading needs the live R-R stream.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap for haptic guidance, you'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connect your strap for haptic guidance, you'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed."}}}},"Connect your strap for haptic guidance. You'll feel one pulse on the inhale, two on the exhale, so you can breathe with your eyes closed.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap for the felt cue. The sweep paces you with one buzz on the inhale, two on the exhale.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap on the Live screen to take a reading.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap to enable": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connect your strap to enable"}}}},"Connect your strap to see live heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap to sync its stored history. Until then, only imported data shows here.": {"localizations": {}},"Connect your strap to test": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connect your strap to test"}}}},"Connect your strap. Calm me is a felt rhythm on the wrist, so it needs a bonded connection.": {"localizations": {}},"Connected": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connected"}}}},"Connected now": {"localizations": {}},"Connected to %@. Pair or switch bands in Devices.": {"localizations": {}},"Connected, waiting for a streaming state.": {"localizations": {}},"Connected.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate is streaming, but your strap is not fully paired. Buzz, alarms and history sync need the encrypted pairing.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Live heart rate is streaming, but your strap is not fully paired. Buzz, alarms and history sync need the encrypted pairing."}}}},"Check automatically": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Check automatically"}}}},"Once a day, NOOP asks GitHub for the latest version number and puts a note in Updates if there's a newer one. Nothing about you is sent, and it never installs anything.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Once a day, NOOP asks GitHub for the latest version number and puts a note in Updates if there's a newer one. Nothing about you is sent, and it never installs anything."}}}},"NOOP %@ is available": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP %@ is available"}}}},"You're on %@. Open Settings and use Check for updates to see what's new and download %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "You're on %@. Open Settings and use Check for updates to see what's new and download %@."}}}},"AltStore or SideStore can install it for you automatically if you added NOOP's source; a direct .ipa still has to be signed on your device.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "AltStore or SideStore can install it for you automatically if you added NOOP's source; a direct .ipa still has to be signed on your device."}}}},"Connected. Finishing the secure pairing handshake…": {"localizations": {}},"Connected. History sync is experimental on 5.0.": {"localizations": {}},"Connected. New strap data is written automatically, with periodic background refresh when iOS allows it.": {"localizations": {}},"Connected; strap history sync is experimental on this strap": {"localizations": {}},"Connecting…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Connecting…"}}}},"Connection": {"localizations": {}},"Connection uptime": {"localizations": {}},"Consistency": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Consistency"}}}},"Continue": {"localizations": {}},"Continue to get your ring ready": {"localizations": {}},"Continuous HRV capture": {"localizations": {}},"Contributors": {"localizations": {}},"Control Center": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Control Center"}}}},"Controls unlocked": {"localizations": {}},"Cooler than your baseline": {"localizations": {}},"Copied!": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Copied!"}}}},"Copy": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Copy"}}}},"Copy %@ address": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Copy %@ address"}}}},"Copy address": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Copy address"}}}},"Copy environment dump": {"localizations": {}},"Copy report.txt": {"localizations": {}},"Copy the redacted report to the clipboard": {"localizations": {}},"Correct when you went to bed and woke. Stages are re-derived from your data; the edit is kept through the next strap sync.": {"localizations": {}},"Could not take over": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't change the app icon": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't check. Try again.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't locate the NOOP database. %@": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't lock today": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't open the backup archive: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't open the local store.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't read clearly": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't read the local store right now. Try again in a moment.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't remove the data: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't restore that backup.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't safely back up right now. Recent changes are still in the write-ahead log.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't safely export right now. Recent changes are still in the database's write-ahead log. Close any in-flight sync, then try again.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't start. Needs a connected strap and a resting heart rate.": {"localizations": {}},"Couldn't write the strap log right now.": {"localizations": {}},"Counter ticks per step. Leave at 1.0 unless your steps run high. On a WHOOP 5/MG they can run very high (10× or more), so this goes up to 30. Walk a known 1,000 steps and divide NOOP's count by the real count to get your value.": {"localizations": {}},"Coupled read": {"localizations": {}},"Coupled view": {"localizations": {}},"Crunching your raw streams…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Crunching your raw streams…"}}}},"Cues sent": {"localizations": {}},"Cup": {"localizations": {}},"Current calibration": {"localizations": {}},"Current charge": {"localizations": {}},"Current physiology, strap trust, and session controls in one working view.": {"localizations": {}},"Current: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Custom": {"localizations": {}},"Custom %lld ml": {"localizations": {}},"Custom marker name": {"localizations": {}},"Custom marker unit": {"localizations": {}},"Custom model id": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Custom model id"}}}},"Custom size": {"localizations": {}},"Customise your cards": {"localizations": {}},"Customised. Your edited instructions frame every reply.": {"localizations": {}},"Customize Today": {"localizations": {}},"Custom…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Custom…"}}}},"Cutoff before bed": {"localizations": {}},"Cycle awareness": {"localizations": {}},"Cycle phase: %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Cycle phase: %@. About day %lld to %lld.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Cycle phase: %1$@. About day %2$lld to %3$lld."}}}},"Cycle phase: %@. About day %lld.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Cycle phase: %1$@. About day %2$lld."}}}},"DATA SOURCES": {"localizations": {}},"DATE": {"localizations": {}},"DAY %lld/%lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "DAY %1$lld/%2$lld"}}}},"DESCRIPTIVE STATS": {"localizations": {}},"DIAGNOSTIC TOOLS": {"localizations": {}},"DIST": {"localizations": {}},"DONE": {"localizations": {}},"DUR": {"localizations": {}},"DURATION + EFFICIENCY + STAGES": {"localizations": {}},"Daily 0–3 proxy": {"localizations": {}},"Daily auto-backup": {"localizations": {}},"Daily auto-export of the strap log": {"localizations": {}},"Daily auto-export time": {"localizations": {}},"Daily signals": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Daily signals"}}}},"Data & App": {"localizations": {}},"Data Sources": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Data Sources"}}}},"Data sources": {"localizations": {}},"Date": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Date"}}}},"Date and time taken": {"localizations": {}},"Date taken": {"localizations": {}},"Day": {"localizations": {}},"Day %lld": {"localizations": {}},"Day 1: bright light %@-%@, lights-out around %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Day 1: bright light %@–%@, lights-out around %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Day 1, bright light %1$@–%2$@, lights-out around %3$@."}}}},"Day Strain": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Day Strain"}}}},"Day Stress": {"localizations": {}},"Day strain": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Day strain"}}}},"Day-cycle background": {"localizations": {}},"Days": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Days"}}}},"Days with higher %@ tend to be your better-mood days.": {"localizations": {}},"Days with higher %@ tend to be your lower-mood days.": {"localizations": {}},"Daytime sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Dec": {"localizations": {}},"Deep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Deep"}}}},"Deep (SWS) Sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Deep Timeline": {"localizations": {}},"Deep Timeline, every second of your day, zoomable": {"localizations": {}},"Deep calm": {"localizations": {}},"Deep data (R22) needs an iPhone or Android. A Mac can't form the encrypted bond a 5/MG requires.": {"localizations": {}},"Deep sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Default": {"localizations": {}},"Delete": {"localizations": {}},"Delete %@": {"localizations": {}},"Delete all of this device's data?": {"localizations": {}},"Delete data": {"localizations": {}},"Delete the %lld millilitre drink logged at %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Delete the %1$lld millilitre drink logged at %2$@"}}}},"Delete this custom question": {"localizations": {}},"Delete this device's data…": {"localizations": {}},"Delete this reading": {"localizations": {}},"Delete this sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Delete this sleep session?": {"localizations": {}},"Depleted": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Depleted"}}}},"Detailed tiles": {"localizations": {}},"Detected": {"localizations": {}},"Device": {"localizations": {}},"Device actions for %@": {"localizations": {}},"Device metrics": {"localizations": {}},"Device name": {"localizations": {}},"Device, iOS build, Data Protection and sideload status, for bug reports.": {"localizations": {}},"Device-config read probe (#103 RE)": {"localizations": {}},"Device-config read probe (#103 RE)…": {"localizations": {}},"Device-config read probe result (#103)": {"localizations": {}},"Devices": {"localizations": {}},"Diagnostics": {"localizations": {}},"Diastolic": {"localizations": {}},"Diastolic blood pressure in mmHg": {"localizations": {}},"Different wake time per day": {"localizations": {}},"Differs slightly": {"localizations": {}},"Disconnect": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Disconnect"}}}},"Disconnect provider": {"localizations": {}},"Disconnected": {"localizations": {}},"Dismiss": {"localizations": {}},"Dismiss (not a workout)": {"localizations": {}},"Dismiss this workout suggestion": {"localizations": {}},"Dismiss to Updates": {"localizations": {}},"Distance": {"localizations": {}},"Distance must be 0–1,000 km.": {"localizations": {}},"Distance, optional": {"localizations": {}},"Don't ask about donations again": {"localizations": {}},"Don't ask again": {"localizations": {}},"Don't buzz when the strap is off your wrist.": {"localizations": {}},"Don't see it?": {"localizations": {}},"Don't see it? That's normal.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Don't see it? That's normal."}}}},"Donate": {"localizations": {}},"Donate or get in touch. Totally optional.": {"localizations": {}},"Donation QR code": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Donation QR code"}}}},"Done": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Done"}}}},"Done customising dashboard": {"localizations": {}},"Done editing Key Metrics": {"localizations": {}},"Done. Save this reading to keep it in your trends.": {"localizations": {}},"Dose-response": {"localizations": {}},"Dose-response curve. Each extra %@ lines up with about %@ on %@, typical patterns.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Dose-response curve. Each extra %1$@ lines up with about %2$@ on %3$@, typical patterns."}}}},"Dose-response curve. Each extra %@ lines up with about %@ on %@, your own data.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Dose-response curve. Each extra %1$@ lines up with about %2$@ on %3$@, your own data."}}}},"Double": {"localizations": {}},"Double tap to collapse": {"localizations": {}},"Double tap to expand": {"localizations": {}},"Double-tap": {"localizations": {}},"Double-tap the strap to trigger an action on %@. (The strap exposes a single double-tap gesture.)": {"localizations": {}},"Download": {"localizations": {}},"Drag to pan · double-tap to reset": {"localizations": {}},"Drag to reorder. Move an item to Hidden to remove it from Today without deleting it.": {"localizations": {}},"Drag to reorder. Toggle a card on or off. Cards with no value yet show a dash.": {"localizations": {}},"Drives your Fitness Age": {"localizations": {}},"Dumps the last 24 hours of decoded per-sample sensor streams (heart rate, R-R, motion, steps, SpO₂, skin temperature, respiration, events) to a single CSV. All on %@, nothing uploaded. Share it to help prototype and test sleep, activity and strength algorithms.": {"localizations": {}},"Duplicate as manual…": {"localizations": {}},"Duration": {"localizations": {}},"Duration in minutes": {"localizations": {}},"During quiet, still, resting windows, NOOP looks at the timing between your heartbeats (R-R intervals) and draws their Poincaré scatter. From the cloud it computes its short and long axes (SD1, SD2) and a few plain regularity numbers. Movement and noisy windows are skipped, not shown. These are transparent, published descriptive statistics: a picture of your timing, never a clinical measurement.": {"localizations": {}},"EARLIER": {"localizations": {}},"EARLY SIGNAL": {"localizations": {}},"ECG capture (MG, experimental)…": {"localizations": {}},"ECG capture probe result": {"localizations": {}},"EFFORT": {"localizations": {}},"EFFORT BUILDING": {"localizations": {}},"EST.": {"localizations": {}},"EXPERIMENTAL ALGORITHMS": {"localizations": {}},"EXPLORATORY": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "EXPLORATORY"}}}},"EXPORT": {"localizations": {}},"EXTRA / SKIPPED": {"localizations": {}},"Each dot pairs one heartbeat interval with the next. A tight line along the diagonal means a steady beat; a rounder, more spread-out cloud means the timing varied more.": {"localizations": {}},"Each line min–max normalized within %@ · %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Each line min–max normalized within %1$@ · %2$@"}}}},"Each line shows how many beats per minute your heart rate changed after exercise. Only high-intensity workouts with recorded post-workout heart rate are included.": {"localizations": {}},"Each metric, where your Apple Watch sits on it, and why.": {"localizations": {}},"Each score follows a published method, computed on your device. We name the method family so you can read up on it, and we never claim to reproduce another company's number exactly.": {"localizations": {}},"Each test logs extra detail for one part of the app while you wear the strap, then bundles it for a bug report.": {"localizations": {}},"Early warning: take it easy": {"localizations": {}},"Edit": {"localizations": {}},"Edit %@": {"localizations": {}},"Edit Key Metrics": {"localizations": {}},"Edit Workout": {"localizations": {}},"Edit coach instructions": {"localizations": {}},"Edit details…": {"localizations": {}},"Edit drink": {"localizations": {}},"Edit how the coach thinks and talks. Takes effect on your next message.": {"localizations": {}},"Edit nap times": {"localizations": {}},"Edit nap times (edited)": {"localizations": {}},"Edit sleep times": {"localizations": {}},"Edit sleep times (edited)": {"localizations": {}},"Edit today's mood": {"localizations": {}},"Edit…": {"localizations": {}},"Effect size": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Effect size"}}}},"Efficiency": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Efficiency"}}}},"Effort": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Effort"}}}},"Effort (0–100)": {"localizations": {}},"Effort scale": {"localizations": {}},"Effort this %@": {"localizations": {}},"Effort: how hard did your heart work?": {"localizations": {}},"Eligible for live physiology": {"localizations": {}},"Email": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Email"}}}},"Email %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Email %@"}}}},"Enable Apple Health": {"localizations": {}},"Enable inactivity reminder": {"localizations": {}},"Enable wrist alerts": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Enable wrist alerts"}}}},"Encrypted": {"localizations": {}},"Encrypted stream: deep controls and history sync available.": {"localizations": {}},"End": {"localizations": {}},"End the experiment plan. Journal and metric history stay untouched.": {"localizations": {}},"End this workout?": {"localizations": {}},"End workout": {"localizations": {}},"Enjoying NOOP?": {"localizations": {}},"Enter NOOP": {"localizations": {}},"Enter a model id": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Enter a model id"}}}},"Enter a sport.": {"localizations": {}},"Entered together; stored as two markers so each lines up cleanly against your signals.": {"localizations": {}},"Equal breath · ~5.5 br/min coherence": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Equal breath · ~5.5 br/min coherence"}}}},"Error: %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Error: %@"}}}},"Est.": {"localizations": {}},"Estimate": {"localizations": {}},"Estimate (partial data)": {"localizations": {}},"Estimate from PPG-derived R-R: relaxation guidance, not a clinical reading. Your pace drifts, so we date it and you can re-measure anytime.": {"localizations": {}},"Estimate from today's effort, your typical sleep and your %lld-night recovery baseline, not a measurement. Your real Charge is scored from tomorrow's HRV when you wake.": {"localizations": {}},"Estimate only, a higher RMSSD while paced usually means your parasympathetic \"rest\" branch is engaging. It is not a clinical reading; trends over a session matter more than any single number.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Estimate only, a higher RMSSD while paced usually means your parasympathetic \"rest\" branch is engaging. It is not a clinical reading; trends over a session matter more than any single number."}}}},"Estimate only: a higher RMSSD while paced usually means your parasympathetic \"rest\" branch is engaging. It is not a clinical reading; trends over a session matter more than any single number.": {"localizations": {}},"Estimated body-clock low around %@": {"localizations": {}},"Estimated from R-R interval": {"localizations": {}},"Estimated from your WHOOP's motion, calibrated to your phone. Not a measured step count.": {"localizations": {}},"Estimated max heart rate · %lld bpm": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Estimated max heart rate · %lld bpm"}}}},"Estimated mostly cleared. Nothing logged is likely still active.": {"localizations": {}},"Estimated runtime left": {"localizations": {}},"Estimated vs your phone": {"localizations": {}},"Eve": {"localizations": {}},"Evening": {"localizations": {}},"Evening forecast": {"localizations": {}},"Event": {"localizations": {}},"Every beat, every night, every day, woven into one quiet picture of you. Welcome to NOOP.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Every beat, every night, every day, woven into one quiet picture of you. Welcome to NOOP."}}}},"Every day": {"localizations": {}},"Every metric is an unvalidated approximation. Don't use NOOP to diagnose, treat, or make any health decision. Always consult a qualified professional.": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"Every release, mirrored. A fallback if GitHub is ever down.": {"localizations": {}},"Every score carries a small honesty label. Calibrating means NOOP is still learning your baseline, or doesn't have enough data yet. Building means there's enough to show, but it's thin. Solid means full inputs are present. When NOOP can't compute a score honestly, it shows nothing rather than a fake number.": {"localizations": {}},"Every second of your day, zoomable.": {"localizations": {}},"Every session, threaded together.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Every session, threaded together."}}}},"Every signal, one tap deep.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Every signal, one tap deep."}}}},"Everyone has a breathing pace (usually between 4.5 and 7 breaths a minute) where the heart's rhythm swings the most with each breath. We pace you through a few candidate paces, measure how your HRV responds, and lock the one that resonates best for you.": {"localizations": {}},"Everything else, one tap away": {"localizations": {}},"Everything here is a pattern in your own logged days: an association with an effect size and confidence, never a cause or a diagnosis. Population patterns are shown as “typical” and are always overridden by your own data once you have enough of it. Approximations, not WHOOP’s scores; not a medical device.": {"localizations": {}},"Everything lives on %@. No account, no sync, no cloud. Your thread is yours alone.": {"localizations": {}},"Everything stays on %@. Bring your history in once, then it's yours.": {"localizations": {}},"Everything stays on this Mac. Bring your history in once, then it's yours.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Everything stays on this Mac. Bring your history in once, then it's yours."}}}},"Everything stays on your device": {"localizations": {}},"Exact model unknown. Shows what every WHOOP can do. * on-device estimate · no SpO₂ % off the strap (import a WHOOP CSV for that).": {"localizations": {}},"Expand for the full read": {"localizations": {}},"Expanded": {"localizations": {}},"Experiment behaviour": {"localizations": {}},"Experiment outcome metric": {"localizations": {}},"Experiment progress": {"localizations": {}},"Experiment window length": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental sleep staging (V2)": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental wellness visualization: not a diagnosis, not an ECG, and not a medical device. It cannot detect any heart condition. Beat-to-beat variation has many ordinary, benign causes. If you feel unwell or are worried, contact a qualified professional; in an emergency, your local emergency service. Everything is computed on your device.": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental · Sleep staging": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental · WHOOP 5 / MG": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Experimental · WHOOP 5 / MG"}}}},"Experimental, and not a medical device": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental, best-effort support. We're still testing these, so they might not connect on every device. They never make up data, and they'll tell you honestly when live isn't possible.": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental: at your own risk": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"Experimental: if your band needs pairing, we'll tell you honestly rather than show a fake reading.": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental: live heart rate where the band exposes it. Some bands need a pairing we can't do yet. NOOP will say so honestly and never show a made-up number. No sleep, recovery, skin temp, SpO₂ or steps.": {"localizations": {}},"Experimental: this is best-effort. If live doesn't work, you can export from Zepp and import the file.": {"localizations": {}},"Explained by": {"localizations": {}},"Explore": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Explore"}}}},"Export": {"localizations": {}},"Export CSV…": {"localizations": {}},"Export NOOP backup": {"localizations": {}},"Export NOOP data as CSV": {"localizations": {}},"Export PDF": {"localizations": {}},"Export failed": {"localizations": {}},"Export failed: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Export for Shortcuts (Apple Health)": {"localizations": {}},"Export frames…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Export frames…"}}}},"Export problem": {"localizations": {}},"Export raw + log": {"localizations": {}},"Export raw sensor data (CSV)": {"localizations": {}},"Export trends report": {"localizations": {}},"Exporting…": {"localizations": {}},"Export…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Export…"}}}},"Extends the sky behind the whole Today screen, so lowering Card transparency lets it show through every card. Needs the day-cycle background on.": {"localizations": {}},"FULL BOND": {"localizations": {}},"FW %@": {"localizations": {}},"Fair": {"localizations": {}},"Fallback": {"localizations": {}},"Fat": {"localizations": {}},"Fat burn": {"localizations": {}},"Feature-flag probe (#761 RE)": {"localizations": {}},"Feature-flag probe (#761 RE)…": {"localizations": {}},"Feature-flag probe result (#761)": {"localizations": {}},"Features": {"localizations": {}},"Feb": {"localizations": {}},"Female": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Female"}}}},"Fetch the available models from %@ using your saved key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fetch the available models from %@ using your saved key"}}}},"File": {"localizations": {}},"Find it in the sidebar under Data Sources.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Find it in the sidebar under Data Sources."}}}},"Find your resonance pace": {"localizations": {}},"Find your strap": {"localizations": {}},"Fine-tune when alerts reach your wrist.": {"localizations": {}},"Finish": {"localizations": {}},"Finishing the pairing handshake. Sync now becomes available once the strap is paired.": {"localizations": {}},"Fire a single haptic pulse on the strap (requires a bonded connection)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fire a single haptic pulse on the strap (requires a bonded connection)"}}}},"Fire a test buzz now": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fire a test buzz now"}}}},"Fire a test haptic buzz on the strap (requires an active strap connection)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fire a test haptic buzz on the strap (requires an active strap connection)"}}}},"Fires a test buzz on your strap": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fires a test buzz on your strap"}}}},"Fires the moment the strap leaves your wrist.": {"localizations": {}},"Firmware version %@": {"localizations": {}},"Fitness Age": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Fitness Age"}}}},"Fitness Age stops here. VO₂max keeps moving.": {"localizations": {}},"Fitness Age %lld, %@. Tap to see the trend.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Fitness Age %1$lld, %2$@. Tap to see the trend."}}}},"Fitness Age %lld, %lld year%@ %@ than your age. Tap to see the trend.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Fitness Age %1$lld, %2$lld year%3$@ %4$@ than your age. Tap to see the trend."}}}},"Fitted from": {"localizations": {}},"Fix in Settings": {"localizations": {}},"Flags accepted, but the enable sequence doesn't start a separate live stream. The deep records arrive as part of the normal history sync (#494).": {"localizations": {}},"Follicular": {"localizations": {}},"For a WHOOP 4.0, which sends no step count: NOOP estimates steps from motion, calibrated to your phone. Tap to see how close it is and adjust it.": {"localizations": {}},"Force-quit the official WHOOP app first, or pairing may fail.": {"localizations": {}},"Forget Oura access": {"localizations": {}},"Forget the saved key and disconnect": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Forget the saved key and disconnect"}}}},"Frame": {"localizations": {}},"Frame summary": {"localizations": {}},"Fri": {"localizations": {}},"Friday": {"localizations": {}},"From": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "From"}}}},"From Apple Health": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"From strap HR": {"localizations": {}},"From the watch's wrist-temperature sensor during sleep, on Series 8 and later. Older models don't have the sensor, so it reads “not available” rather than zero.": {"localizations": {}},"From your nightly sensor": {"localizations": {}},"From your nightly temperature": {"localizations": {}},"Full day": {"localizations": {}},"Full strap stream is active.": {"localizations": {}},"Full sweep · ~13 min": {"localizations": {}},"Fully quit and reopen NOOP to load it.": {"localizations": {}},"Functional strength": {"localizations": {}},"Fused on %@. Nothing leaves it: no account, no cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"Garmin watch": {"localizations": {}},"Generated by NOOP on %@ · all on-device, no account, no cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"Get Started": {"localizations": {}},"Get a notification when the strap battery runs low (15%) so you can top it up before tonight, and when it finishes charging.": {"localizations": {}},"Get in touch": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Get in touch"}}}},"Get it ready, then scan.": {"localizations": {}},"Get the latest release": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Get the latest release"}}}},"Get your ring ready": {"localizations": {}},"Getting your devices ready": {"localizations": {}},"GitHub: code, releases, issues and the wiki.": {"localizations": {}},"Give %@ %@ a name you'll recognise.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Give %1$@ %2$@ a name you'll recognise."}}}},"Give it a few minutes of charge if the battery is low.": {"localizations": {}},"Goes to the Apple Health permission step": {"localizations": {}},"Going to sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Good": {"localizations": {}},"Good afternoon": {"localizations": {}},"Good evening": {"localizations": {}},"Good morning": {"localizations": {}},"Good morning. Your smart alarm just woke you.": {"localizations": {}},"Got it": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Got it"}}}},"Grab this when you report a bug. It tells me what the app saw.": {"localizations": {}},"Grab this when you report a bug. It tells me what the app saw. (The full live log is also on the Live screen.)": {"localizations": {}},"Grant Health access": {"localizations": {}},"Gravity coverage": {"localizations": {}},"Great": {"localizations": {}},"Group": {"localizations": {}},"Guarding your session. Silence means you're on track.": {"localizations": {}},"Gym equipment": {"localizations": {}},"Gym equipment (FTMS)": {"localizations": {}},"HEART RATE": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "HEART RATE"}}}},"HF power": {"localizations": {}},"HIGH": {"localizations": {}},"HOURS OF SLEEP": {"localizations": {}},"HR %@ · Effort %@": {"localizations": {}},"HR ZONE": {"localizations": {}},"HR Zones": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "HR Zones"}}}},"HR Zones (All)": {"localizations": {}},"HR Zones 1–3": {"localizations": {}},"HR Zones 4–5": {"localizations": {}},"HR density (per min)": {"localizations": {}},"HR eased %lld → %lld over %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "HR eased %1$lld → %2$lld over %3$@."}}}},"HR held steady (%lld → %lld). Try a paced breath instead.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "HR held steady (%1$lld → %2$lld). Try a paced breath instead."}}}},"HR settled %lld → %lld over %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "HR settled %1$lld → %2$lld over %3$@."}}}},"HR settled over %@.": {"localizations": {}},"HR unavailable": {"localizations": {}},"HR-from-PPG sub-lag interpolation (v26 gap-fill)": {"localizations": {}},"HR-zone coaching": {"localizations": {}},"HRV": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "HRV"}}}},"HRV %@ · RHR %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "HRV %1$@ · RHR %2$@"}}}},"HRV %lld%% over baseline": {"localizations": {}},"HRV %lld%% under baseline": {"localizations": {}},"HRV (RMSSD)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "HRV (RMSSD)"}}}},"HRV Reading": {"localizations": {}},"HRV has dropped well below your baseline, pointing to elevated stress or fatigue. Ease off and give your body time to recover.": {"localizations": {}},"HRV is above baseline, a sign of a relaxed, well-recovered nervous system. Stress is low.": {"localizations": {}},"HRV is below your baseline, so ease into the day": {"localizations": {}},"HRV readiness (Plews/Altini)": {"localizations": {}},"HRV readiness (experimental)": {"localizations": {}},"HRV readiness (experimental): %@": {"localizations": {}},"HRV reading": {"localizations": {}},"HRV reading not started": {"localizations": {}},"HRV window": {"localizations": {}},"HRV ↔ Charge": {"localizations": {}},"Had it": {"localizations": {}},"Haptic coaching": {"localizations": {}},"Haptic-paced breathing · find your pace · calm down": {"localizations": {}},"Haptic-paced breathing · watch your HRV respond": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Haptic-paced breathing · watch your HRV respond"}}}},"Haptics on": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Haptics on"}}}},"Hard to read right now": {"localizations": {}},"Heads up: this test mode is off, so the report has no capture for it. For a useful report, turn the mode on, reproduce the problem while wearing the strap, then report again.": {"localizations": {}},"Heads-up": {"localizations": {}},"Heads-up. Your WHOOP only talks to one phone at a time. Force-quit the official WHOOP app first, or pairing may fail.": {"localizations": {}},"Health": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Health"}}}},"Health Monitor": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Health Monitor"}}}},"Health database": {"localizations": {}},"Health insights": {"localizations": {}},"Heart & Vitals": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Heart & Vitals"}}}},"Heart Rate": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Heart Rate"}}}},"Heart Rate Recovery": {"localizations": {}},"Heart Rate Variability": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate %lld beats per minute": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Heart rate %lld beats per minute"}}}},"Heart rate (live, best-effort)": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate during %@": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate not available": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate plus active energy give a solid daily cardiovascular load. An on-watch workout sharpens it further.": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate recovery at %@, %lld beats per minute": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate recovery at %@, not available": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate stream is active.": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate variability": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Heart rate variability"}}}},"Heart rate · HRV (live)* · Strain": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate · HRV · Skin temp* · Resp rate* · Sleep · Strain · Battery": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate · HRV · Skin temp* · Resp rate* · Steps* · Sleep · Strain · Battery": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate · HRV* · Sleep · Resting HR · Skin temp* · Battery": {"localizations": {}},"Heart rate* · HRV* · Sleep* · Resting HR* · Skin temp* · Battery*": {"localizations": {}},"Heart-rate recovery trend in beats per minute": {"localizations": {}},"Heart-rate recovery · %@": {"localizations": {}},"Heart-rate strap": {"localizations": {}},"Heart-rate variability": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Heart-rate variability"}}}},"Heart-rate variability as the engine behind your charge score.": {"localizations": {}},"Heart-rate zone split: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Height": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Height"}}}},"Height in centimetres": {"localizations": {}},"Height in inches": {"localizations": {}},"Height, %lld feet %lld inches": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Height, %1$lld feet %2$lld inches"}}}},"Help & Contact": {"localizations": {}},"Helping most: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Hidden": {"localizations": {}},"Hidden items remain available here and can be restored at any time.": {"localizations": {}},"Hide %@": {"localizations": {}},"Hide data source detail": {"localizations": {}},"Hide this question": {"localizations": {}},"High": {"localizations": {}},"History": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "History"}}}},"History fills the dashboard immediately": {"localizations": {}},"History stays under the original question so WHOOP imports still line up.": {"localizations": {}},"History sync": {"localizations": {}},"History sync is experimental on 5.0.": {"localizations": {}},"History synced": {"localizations": {}},"History synced %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "History synced %@"}}}},"Holding you back: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Holds the screen awake while you're recording a workout, so your live heart rate stays visible without the device dimming. Only applies during a recording. The screen sleeps normally the rest of the time. Leaving it on does use a bit more battery, and means your unlocked screen stays visible for the whole workout, so flip it off if that's a concern.": {"localizations": {}},"Hours asleep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Hours asleep"}}}},"Hours asleep trend": {"localizations": {}},"Hours vs Needed": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Hours vs Needed"}}}},"How %@ is calculated": {"localizations": {}},"How Charge is calculated": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How Charge is calculated"}}}},"How Charge is calculated. The method behind the score.": {"localizations": {}},"How Charge, Effort and Rest are calculated, and how they differ from WHOOP.": {"localizations": {}},"How Effort is calculated": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How Effort is calculated"}}}},"How NOOP splits a night into light / deep / REM. This is a separate, opt-in recipe. Your default staging is unchanged unless you turn it on.": {"localizations": {}},"How NOOP works": {"localizations": {}},"How Rest is calculated": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How Rest is calculated"}}}},"How Stress is calculated": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How Stress is calculated"}}}},"How They Move Together": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How They Move Together"}}}},"How accurate is this?": {"localizations": {}},"How accurate is this? %@ the data behind your Fitness Age": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {}},"How accurate is this? Hide the data behind your Fitness Age": {"localizations": {}},"How accurate is this? Show the data behind your Fitness Age": {"localizations": {}},"How closely a good night tracks next-morning charge.": {"localizations": {}},"How much one day's charge carries into the next.": {"localizations": {}},"How recovered you are, led by HRV versus your personal baseline.": {"localizations": {}},"How restorative your sleep was: duration, efficiency, deep+REM, timing.": {"localizations": {}},"How see-through the cards (Heart Rate, Key Metrics, Recovery Vitals, …) are. Left = solid, right = clear.": {"localizations": {}},"How strong the buzz is.": {"localizations": {}},"How sure is NOOP?  ·  Solid · Building · Calibrating": {"localizations": {}},"How this is computed": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How this is computed"}}}},"How this is measured": {"localizations": {}},"How this score is calculated": {"localizations": {}},"How this works": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "How this works"}}}},"How to read this": {"localizations": {}},"How to read this: HRV, Resting HR, Sleep duration, Respiratory rate and Skin temperature are measured from the strap (skin temp is shown as the deviation from your own baseline). Workouts is the count of activities you logged or that were detected. Recovery, Strain and Stress are NOOP's own on-device scores, not clinical measures: Recovery is a daily readiness composite (HRV, resting HR, sleep and skin-temp trend), Strain is cardiovascular load derived from heart rate, and Stress is a 0-3 autonomic-load index from resting HR and HRV.": {"localizations": {}},"How to read this: HRV, Resting HR, Sleep duration, Respiratory rate and Skin temperature are measured from the strap (skin temp is shown as the deviation from your own baseline). Workouts is the count of activities you logged or that were detected. Recovery, Strain and Stress are NOOP's own on-device scores, not clinical measures: Recovery is a daily readiness composite (HRV, resting HR, sleep and skin-temp trend), Strain is cardiovascular load derived from heart rate, and Stress is a 0–3 autonomic-load index from resting HR and HRV.": {"localizations": {}},"How your scores are computed": {"localizations": {}},"How your scores work": {"localizations": {}},"How your sleep is sorted": {"localizations": {}},"How's my charge trending?": {"localizations": {}},"How's your mood today?": {"localizations": {}},"Hydration": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Hydration"}}}},"Hydration today": {"localizations": {}},"Hydration tracking": {"localizations": {}},"Hypnogram": {"localizations": {}},"I have read and accept these terms, and I'm using NOOP with my own device and my own data, at my own risk.": {"localizations": {}},"I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in, no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in, no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us."}}}},"I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in: no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us.": {"localizations": {}},"I understand": {"localizations": {}},"I understand this disconnects the ring from Oura and that NOOP cannot undo it for me.": {"localizations": {}},"I understand this disconnects the ring from Oura and that NOOP cannot undo it for me. To go back to Oura I would factory-reset the ring again and set it up in the Oura app.": {"localizations": {}},"I understand this is an experimental wellness feature, not a medical device or a diagnosis.": {"localizations": {}},"I'm awake": {"localizations": {}},"I'm wearing it": {"localizations": {}},"IDLE": {"localizations": {}},"INBOX": {"localizations": {}},"Idle": {"localizations": {}},"If it's saving you a subscription, a suggested $50+ (a fraction of a year of WHOOP) genuinely keeps the project alive. Anything is appreciated. Crypto only; the project stays anonymous.": {"localizations": {}},"If the Oura app is still running it will hold the ring and adoption will fail. Force-quit Oura, then scan.": {"localizations": {}},"If you don't see the prompt, enable NOOP under Settings › Health › Data Access & Devices.": {"localizations": {}},"If you don't see the prompt, turn NOOP on under Settings › Health › Data Access & Devices.": {"localizations": {}},"If you extracted your ring's 16-byte key from a previous Oura setup, NOOP can talk to the ring with that key without resetting it, so the Oura app keeps working too. NOOP does not extract keys for you and cannot help you find one. If you do not know what this means, go back and use the standard setup or file import.": {"localizations": {}},"If you feel unwell or are worried about your heart, contact a qualified professional; in an emergency, your local emergency service. Do not rely on NOOP.": {"localizations": {}},"If you're still seated, buzz again this often.": {"localizations": {}},"Illness early-warning": {"localizations": {}},"Imaging": {"localizations": {}},"Imperial": {"localizations": {}},"Import": {"localizations": {}},"Import Apple Health data?": {"localizations": {}},"Import Apple Health export": {"localizations": {}},"Import NOOP backup": {"localizations": {}},"Import WHOOP export": {"localizations": {}},"Import a WHOOP export, Apple Health or a second band and your best-sourced record builds here, on this device.": {"localizations": {}},"Import a single exported workout file from any brand (Garmin, Coros, Suunto, Wahoo, Polar, Strava, Apple) straight off your device. GPS route, distance, heart rate and calories come in where the file has them. Fully offline; nothing leaves %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Import again": {"localizations": {}},"Import an Apple Health export (Health app → profile → Export All Health Data → export.zip). 7 years of HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂, steps and more, streamed locally. Large exports take a minute or two.": {"localizations": {}},"Import daily nutrition totals from a Cronometer or MacroFactor CSV export: calories in, protein, carbs, fat (and weight if present). Other trackers work too if the file has a date column and daily totals.": {"localizations": {}},"Import failed. Your existing data was kept. %@": {"localizations": {}},"Import failed: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Import readings": {"localizations": {}},"Import temp files": {"localizations": {}},"Import your Mi Band history (steps, heart rate, resting HR, sleep stages, SpO₂, stress and sleep score) straight from the Mi Fitness app. On your iPhone: Files → On My iPhone → Mi Fitness, long-press the folder → Compress, then choose the .zip here. Fully offline; no Xiaomi account or Bluetooth needed. Smart Band 8/9/10.": {"localizations": {}},"Import your full WHOOP history (recovery, strain, sleep, workouts) from a data export (.zip). Works for WHOOP 4.0, 5.0 and MG. Get one at app.whoop.com → Data Management.": {"localizations": {}},"Import your history first. A WHOOP export in Data Sources fills every metric you can explore here in about a minute.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Import your history first. A WHOOP export in Data Sources fills every metric you can explore here in about a minute."}}}},"Import your own data export from Oura, Fitbit or Garmin: sleep, resting heart rate, HRV, steps and more, where the export has them. Download it from the brand's app (Oura: Account → Export Data; Fitbit: Google Takeout; Garmin: Export Your Data), then choose the file here. Fully offline; nothing leaves %@. Each brand's own readiness or sleep score is kept for reference only. Your scores stay yours.": {"localizations": {}},"Import your strength-training history from a Hevy CSV export or a Liftosaur JSON export. Each workout becomes a Strength session with a training-volume estimate (weight × reps). It's a volume figure, not a measured strain. It never changes your Effort.": {"localizations": {}},"Imported": {"localizations": {}},"Imported %lld days (%lld values)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Imported %1$lld days (%2$lld values)"}}}},"Imported %lld workouts": {"localizations": {}},"Imported 1 workout": {"localizations": {}},"Importing overwrites everything currently on %@. Your old data is kept in a side file just in case. NOOP needs a relaunch for an import to take effect. Export CSV writes a WHOOP-format zip of your days, sleeps, workouts and journal that re-imports into NOOP on Mac, iPhone, or Android. On-device computed rows are marked APPROXIMATE in its Source column; the full backup stays the lossless restore path.": {"localizations": {}},"Importing overwrites everything currently on this Mac. Your old data is kept in a side file just in case. NOOP needs a relaunch for an import to take effect.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Importing overwrites everything currently on this Mac. Your old data is kept in a side file just in case. NOOP needs a relaunch for an import to take effect."}}}},"Importing…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Importing…"}}}},"Import…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Import…"}}}},"In and out, but the band won more than it lost.": {"localizations": {}},"In band": {"localizations": {}},"In your band. On track.": {"localizations": {}},"In your data so far, this doesn’t move your %@ the way it typically does.": {"localizations": {}},"In your range": {"localizations": {}},"Inactivity reminder": {"localizations": {}},"Incl. Helio. Live heart rate where the band exposes it. Help us test.": {"localizations": {}},"Independent, and experimental": {"localizations": {}},"Independent: not affiliated with WHOOP": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"Informational only, not medical advice.": {"localizations": {}},"Insights": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Insights"}}}},"Insights read your journal and outcomes. Import your WHOOP export, which includes your journal, in Data Sources to unlock them.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Insights read your journal and outcomes. Import your WHOOP export, which includes your journal, in Data Sources to unlock them."}}}},"Installed outside the App Store": {"localizations": {}},"Installing NOOP's key and confirming the ring answers only to NOOP. Keep the ring close and do not open the Oura app.": {"localizations": {}},"Intelligence": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Intelligence"}}}},"Intensity Minutes": {"localizations": {}},"Intensity minutes": {"localizations": {}},"Interrogate what affects what.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Interrogate what affects what."}}}},"Interval Timer": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Interval Timer"}}}},"Intervals": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Intervals"}}}},"Intervention": {"localizations": {}},"Intraday": {"localizations": {}},"It all stays on your strap and %@: no account, no cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"It is a picture, not a verdict": {"localizations": {}},"Which value means “left” and which means “right” comes from WHOOP's own app and the strap firmware, not from a strap NOOP has tested. You can send it again with the other choice at any time, and it changes nothing about your recorded data.": {"localizations": {}},"It is not a substitute for a professional": {"localizations": {}},"It isn't held by the WHOOP phone app. Only one host at a time: close the app or turn off its Bluetooth.": {"localizations": {}},"It shows the shape of your heartbeat timing and a plain-language description of how steady it looked. It does not tell you whether anything is right or wrong.": {"localizations": {}},"It's a notebook, not a lab. NOOP lines up the numbers you enter. It doesn't test, read, or judge them. Not medical advice.": {"localizations": {}},"It's charged and worn. The sensor needs skin contact to wake.": {"localizations": {}},"It's within about a metre of %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Jan": {"localizations": {}},"Journal": {"localizations": {}},"Journal reminder": {"localizations": {}},"Jul": {"localizations": {}},"Jun": {"localizations": {}},"KCAL": {"localizations": {}},"KEY METRICS": {"localizations": {}},"Keep it within about a metre of %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Keep last exports": {"localizations": {}},"Keep last snapshots": {"localizations": {}},"Keep screen on during a workout": {"localizations": {}},"Keep the Oura app instead (import a file)": {"localizations": {}},"Keep the Oura app instead, import a file": {"localizations": {}},"Keep the ring on the charger or on your finger so it stays awake.": {"localizations": {}},"Keep your bloods, BP and body numbers private, on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Keep your own numbers here": {"localizations": {}},"Keeps the detailed beat-to-beat heart-rate stream running all day and night, not just while a live screen is open, so NOOP captures much more for overnight HRV, recovery and sleep. Uses more battery: your strap streams heart rate continuously while connected.": {"localizations": {}},"Key Metrics": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Key Metrics"}}}},"Kick in at (strap battery)": {"localizations": {}},"LAST NIGHT": {"localizations": {}},"LAST WORKOUTS": {"localizations": {}},"LIVE HR ONLY": {"localizations": {}},"LIVE PHYSIOLOGY": {"localizations": {}},"LIVE SESSION": {"localizations": {}},"LOCAL ONLY": {"localizations": {}},"LONG AXIS": {"localizations": {}},"LOW": {"localizations": {}},"LOW SIGNAL": {"localizations": {}},"Lab Book": {"localizations": {}},"Lab Book is a private notebook, not a medical service. NOOP stores and lines up the numbers you enter. It doesn't test, read, diagnose, or advise. Your records never leave %@; there's no account or cloud, so it isn't \"HIPAA-covered.\" Always rely on your doctor or pharmacist to interpret results.": {"localizations": {}},"Lab Book keeps your own numbers. It doesn't test, read, or judge them, and it's not medical advice. Everything stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Last %lld beats": {"localizations": {}},"Last 14 nights": {"localizations": {}},"Last 30 days": {"localizations": {}},"Last 6 months": {"localizations": {}},"Last 7 days": {"localizations": {}},"Last 90 days": {"localizations": {}},"Last Charge breakdown": {"localizations": {}},"Last HRV reading": {"localizations": {}},"Last backup: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Last gate fired": {"localizations": {}},"Last import": {"localizations": {}},"Last night": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Last night"}}}},"Last night · %@": {"localizations": {}},"Last night, %@. Tonight's lands after you sleep with the strap on.": {"localizations": {}},"Last night, read in two seconds.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Last night, read in two seconds."}}}},"Last offload completed": {"localizations": {}},"Last offload result": {"localizations": {}},"Last reported by strap": {"localizations": {}},"Last reported by the ring": {"localizations": {}},"Last seen %@": {"localizations": {}},"Last session": {"localizations": {}},"Last session: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Last sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Last sync": {"localizations": {}},"Last synced %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Last synced %lld minutes ago. Reconnect to pull the latest.": {"localizations": {}},"Last synced %lldm ago": {"localizations": {}},"Last week": {"localizations": {}},"Last year": {"localizations": {}},"Later": {"localizations": {}},"Latest": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Latest"}}}},"Latest Workouts": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Latest Workouts"}}}},"Latest entry: %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Latest reading": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Latest reading"}}}},"Latest sleep · %@": {"localizations": {}},"Latest sleep, %@. This is your last scored session. Wear the strap overnight for a fresh score.": {"localizations": {}},"Lean Body Mass": {"localizations": {}},"Lean Mass": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Lean Mass"}}}},"Lean body mass": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Lean body mass"}}}},"Learning": {"localizations": {}},"Learning your baseline, %lld of %lld nights.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Learning your baseline, %1$lld of %2$lld nights."}}}},"Learning your pattern": {"localizations": {}},"Leave none active": {"localizations": {}},"Led by your heart-rate variability (HRV) measured against your own personal baseline, plus resting heart rate, last night's Rest, breathing rate, and a skin-temperature signal (an early illness or overreach flag). Higher HRV versus your baseline means more Charge. NOOP needs a few nights to learn your baseline first. Until then you'll see “Calibrating”.": {"localizations": {}},"Led by your heart-rate variability versus your own baseline. The watch samples HRV rather than streaming it, so this needs about a week of nights to calibrate. Until then NOOP shows “needs more data”, never a guessed number.": {"localizations": {}},"Left wrist": {"localizations": {}},"Leftover import copies": {"localizations": {}},"Let NOOP tap your wrist for the things you turn on below, so you can leave your phone and still feel what matters.": {"localizations": {}},"Let the check-in fire on its own. Off keeps it manual: you start a breath from Breathe yourself.": {"localizations": {}},"Let the coach use my data": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Let the coach use my data"}}}},"Lifestyle": {"localizations": {}},"Lifting": {"localizations": {}},"Lifting log (Hevy / Liftosaur)": {"localizations": {}},"Light": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Light"}}}},"Light + sleep timing only": {"localizations": {}},"Light Sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Likely your Oura warranty and support, because the ring is no longer paired to Oura. Treat this as permanent.": {"localizations": {}},"Lining them up…": {"localizations": {}},"Liquid Today (prototype)": {"localizations": {}},"Listening for the strap's reply…": {"localizations": {}},"Live": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Live"}}}},"Live Body Console": {"localizations": {}},"Live HR": {"localizations": {}},"Live HR (not fully paired)": {"localizations": {}},"Live HR + R-R only · no sleep, recovery, skin temp, SpO₂, steps or battery (those are WHOOP-only).": {"localizations": {}},"Live HR works. Free the strap to unlock buzz, alarms & sync": {"localizations": {}},"Live Session": {"localizations": {}},"Live Sessions (beta)": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate already works on a WHOOP 5/MG strap. These probes go further and try to coax more out of it. They are guesses, off by default, and only ever touch a 5/MG strap, WHOOP 4.0 is never affected.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Live heart rate already works on a WHOOP 5/MG strap. These probes go further and try to coax more out of it. They are guesses, off by default, and only ever touch a 5/MG strap, WHOOP 4.0 is never affected."}}}},"Live heart rate already works on a WHOOP 5/MG strap. These probes go further and try to coax more out of it. They are guesses, off by default, and only ever touch a 5/MG strap. WHOOP 4.0 is never affected.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate and energy, recorded on your wrist. Stays on device.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate appears here once a strap is connected.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate is flowing; full strap controls need an encrypted bond.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate is instant. Recovery, strain and sleep sharpen as NOOP learns your baseline over your first nights of wear. Want your history now? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate on bands that don't need pairing. Help us test.": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate over time": {"localizations": {}},"Live heart rate, and HRV when the ring can measure it.": {"localizations": {}},"Live machine data over Bluetooth FTMS. No sleep, recovery, skin temp or SpO₂. Effort needs the machine's heart rate; without it the session logs the machine metrics only.": {"localizations": {}},"Live now. Your scores are building.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Live now. Your scores are building."}}}},"Live vitals, streamed from the strap.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Live vitals, streamed from the strap."}}}},"Live · beat by beat": {"localizations": {}},"Loading the day…": {"localizations": {}},"Loading your history…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Loading your history…"}}}},"Loading your sessions…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Loading your sessions…"}}}},"Loading your sleep history…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Loading your sleep history…"}}}},"Local Oura support is new and we cannot test every ring here. It may not connect on your ring, and it can change between updates. NOOP never makes up a number. If something does not work, it will tell you plainly.": {"localizations": {}},"Lock %@": {"localizations": {}},"Lock the Mac when I take the strap off": {"localizations": {}},"Locked": {"localizations": {}},"Locked %@ · paces drift, re-measure anytime.": {"localizations": {}},"Locked %@. Switch to Breathe to use it, or re-measure above.": {"localizations": {}},"Log": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Log"}}}},"Log %@": {"localizations": {}},"Log a coffee, tea, or energy drink and NOOP shows a rough estimate of how much may still be active. It's a guide based on a typical 5 to 6 hour half-life, not a measurement.": {"localizations": {}},"Log a session you tracked elsewhere.": {"localizations": {}},"Log a sleep mark": {"localizations": {}},"Log alcohol or late caffeine with an amount and NOOP fits a personal dose curve: how much each extra unit tends to move your numbers. Until then it shows typical patterns, clearly labelled as not yet yours.": {"localizations": {}},"Log at least one behaviour above before starting an experiment.": {"localizations": {}},"Log behaviours above. After a few days of answers, NOOP ranks how each one moves your charge, HRV and rest. Importing a WHOOP export (which includes its journal) backfills history instantly.": {"localizations": {}},"Log custom %lld millilitres": {"localizations": {}},"Log going to sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Log journal": {"localizations": {}},"Log period start": {"localizations": {}},"Log today's journal": {"localizations": {}},"Log waking up": {"localizations": {}},"Logged %lld millilitres at %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Logged %1$lld millilitres at %2$@"}}}},"Logged as a nap. Wrong? Tap Edit to adjust your sleep and wake times.": {"localizations": {}},"Logged bedtime at %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Logged sessions across %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Logged today": {"localizations": {}},"Logged wake-up at %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Logging ahead for tomorrow: today's activities inform tomorrow's recovery, just as yesterday's are reflected in today's. Tomorrow's answers line up with tomorrow's morning.": {"localizations": {}},"Long": {"localizations": {}},"Long exhale · downshift to rest": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Long exhale · downshift to rest"}}}},"Long press to show or hide your heart rate.": {"localizations": {}},"Longer ranges unlock as more history builds.": {"localizations": {}},"Longest: %lld days": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Longest: %lld days"}}}},"Longest: 1 day": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Longest: 1 day"}}}},"Looks like a workout": {"localizations": {}},"Looks like a workout around %@–%@ (avg HR %lld, %lld min). Save it?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Looks like a workout around %1$@–%2$@ (avg HR %3$lld, %4$lld min). Save it?"}}}},"Looks like a workout on %@ around %@–%@ (avg HR %lld, %lld min). Save it?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Looks like a workout on %1$@ around %2$@–%3$@ (avg HR %4$lld, %5$lld min). Save it?"}}}},"Looks like a workout yesterday around %@–%@ (avg HR %lld, %lld min). Save it?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Looks like a workout yesterday around %1$@–%2$@ (avg HR %3$lld, %4$lld min). Save it?"}}}},"Low": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Low"}}}},"Low battery": {"localizations": {}},"Low confidence": {"localizations": {}},"Low confidence staging. This night scored high efficiency but very little deep or REM, more likely an estimate miss than a real restorative shortfall.": {"localizations": {}},"Luteal": {"localizations": {}},"M": {"localizations": {}},"MEDIUM": {"localizations": {}},"METHOD": {"localizations": {}},"Day starts": {"localizations": {}},"Default. Steps and in-progress Effort restart at the beginning of detected main sleep. Naps do not start a new day; missing sleep falls back to local midnight.": {"localizations": {}},"Uses a conventional local calendar day from 00:00 to 00:00.": {"localizations": {}},"Main sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Maintain": {"localizations": {}},"Make %@ your active device now? It will provide your live data. You can change this any time.": {"localizations": {}},"Make %@ your active strap? From now on it provides your live data. %@'s history stays exactly as it is. Only new days come from %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Make %1$@ your active strap? From now on it provides your live data. %2$@'s history stays exactly as it is, only new days come from %3$@."}}}},"Make active": {"localizations": {}},"Make it yours": {"localizations": {}},"Make sure it isn't already connected to another app (Zwift, the gym's app, a bike computer…).": {"localizations": {}},"Make sure it isn't connected to another app (a bike computer, the brand's own app…).": {"localizations": {}},"Make sure it's NOT connected to the official WHOOP app right now.": {"localizations": {}},"Make sure it's awake and not connected elsewhere.": {"localizations": {}},"Make sure the Oura app is fully closed. A ring answers one owner at a time.": {"localizations": {}},"Make the strap do things, tap to act, walk away to lock, train by feel.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Make the strap do things, tap to act, walk away to lock, train by feel."}}}},"Make the strap do things: tap to act, walk away to lock, train by feel.": {"localizations": {}},"Make this your active device?": {"localizations": {}},"Make this your active strap?": {"localizations": {}},"Makes your WHOOP 5.0/MG advertise its heart rate as a standard Bluetooth HR sensor, so a Garmin (Edge/watch), Zwift or gym equipment can use it during a workout. Applied on the next connection (and immediately if connected); writes the strap's whoop_live_hr_in_adv_ind_pkt flag. Reversible. iPhone-side only. A Mac can't write to a 5/MG.": {"localizations": {}},"Male": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Male"}}}},"Manage devices": {"localizations": {}},"Manual": {"localizations": {}},"Manual (you set this by hand)": {"localizations": {}},"Manual override": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Manual override"}}}},"Manual steps coefficient": {"localizations": {}},"Map of your %@ route, %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Map of your %1$@ route, %2$@."}}}},"Mar": {"localizations": {}},"Mark a Moment": {"localizations": {}},"Mark a moment": {"localizations": {}},"Mark all read": {"localizations": {}},"Mark done today": {"localizations": {}},"Mark optical experiment phase": {"localizations": {}},"Mark the start of each physical phase while wearing or handling the strap. NOOP aligns the marker to the timestamp inside delayed history buffers, then the offline analyzer compares block activation, header bytes and raw ADC changes. It does not assume a wavelength or calculate SpO₂/BP.": {"localizations": {}},"Marker": {"localizations": {}},"Markers": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Markers"}}}},"Match": {"localizations": {}},"Max": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max"}}}},"Max 4": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max 4"}}}},"Max HR": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max HR"}}}},"Max Heart Rate": {"localizations": {}},"Max heart rate": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max heart rate"}}}},"Max heart rate override": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max heart rate override"}}}},"Max heart rate override, %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Max heart rate override, %@"}}}},"Maximum": {"localizations": {}},"May": {"localizations": {}},"Mean": {"localizations": {}},"Mean %@": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Mean %@"}}}},"Mean HR": {"localizations": {}},"Measurement system": {"localizations": {}},"Measuring…": {"localizations": {}},"Medium": {"localizations": {}},"Menu and settings": {"localizations": {}},"Metric": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Metric"}}}},"Metric Relationships": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Metric Relationships"}}}},"Metrics": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Metrics"}}}},"Mi Band": {"localizations": {}},"Mid-cycle shift": {"localizations": {}},"Min": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Min"}}}},"Mind": {"localizations": {}},"Minutes seated before the first nudge.": {"localizations": {}},"Min–max normalized · sparse series widened past %@ · %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Min–max normalized · sparse series widened past %1$@ · %2$@"}}}},"Mirror at noop dot fans, a fallback if GitHub is down": {"localizations": {}},"Mirror: noop.fans": {"localizations": {}},"Missing": {"localizations": {}},"Model": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Model"}}}},"Moderate": {"localizations": {}},"Moment marked.": {"localizations": {}},"Mon": {"localizations": {}},"Monday": {"localizations": {}},"Mood": {"localizations": {}},"Mood, alongside your body's signals": {"localizations": {}},"More": {"localizations": {}},"Morning": {"localizations": {}},"Most Active": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Most Active"}}}},"Mostly %@ (%@).": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Mostly %1$@, %2$@."}}}},"Mostly over the band — harder than today's Charge could pay for.": {"localizations": {}},"Mostly steady, with a few isolated extra or skipped beats. Very common and usually nothing.": {"localizations": {}},"Mostly under the band — there was more in the tank today.": {"localizations": {}},"Motion": {"localizations": {}},"Motion-aware wake refinement": {"localizations": {}},"Move": {"localizations": {}},"Move %@ down": {"localizations": {}},"Move %@ up": {"localizations": {}},"Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything (history, sleeps, workouts, settings) to a single file you can copy across; import replaces %@'s data with a backup.": {"localizations": {}},"Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything, history, sleeps, workouts, settings, to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything, history, sleeps, workouts, settings, to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup."}}}},"Move anyway": {"localizations": {}},"Move reminder": {"localizations": {}},"Move this sleep?": {"localizations": {}},"Movement": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Movement"}}}},"Mute wrist alerts overnight.": {"localizations": {}},"My Dashboard": {"localizations": {}},"My WHOOP": {"localizations": {}},"N-of-1 protocol": {"localizations": {}},"NES / HUNT VO2MAX": {"localizations": {}},"NEW": {"localizations": {}},"NO DATA": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NO DATA"}}}},"NOOP": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP"}}}},"NOOP %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP %@"}}}},"NOOP %@ is here. Tap to read what's new.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP Charge": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP can read a coarse menstrual-cycle phase from your nightly skin temperature, entirely on your device. It is awareness only: not contraception, not a fertility predictor, not a medical service.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP can run off only an Apple Watch, no chest strap needed. The watch is the sensor; NOOP does the thinking on your phone, computing Charge, Rest, Effort and your Fitness Age from your Health data, all on-device.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP can tap your wrist when your %@ needs you. No glance at the screen required.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP computed": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP estimates your steps from your WHOOP's motion, calibrated to your phone's step count. It's an estimate, not a step counter. A WHOOP 4.0 doesn't transmit steps.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP gives you three daily scores (Charge, Effort and Rest), each on a 0-100 scale. They're built from your strap's raw signals using published, peer-reviewed sport science, and computed entirely on your device. They are NOT WHOOP's scores: we don't have WHOOP's private algorithms and don't pretend to. They aim at the same three questions using open science, so they'll usually track WHOOP's in direction, but won't match number-for-number. And that's the point.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP gives you three daily scores (Charge, Effort and Rest), each on a 0–100 scale. They're built from your strap's raw signals using published, peer-reviewed sport science, and computed entirely on your device. They are NOT WHOOP's scores: we don't have WHOOP's private algorithms and don't pretend to. They aim at the same three questions using open science, so they'll usually track WHOOP's in direction, but won't match number-for-number. And that's the point.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP is a personal, open project: not the WHOOP app, and not affiliated with WHOOP. It reads a strap you own, on your own device. Treat it as a capable work-in-progress rather than a finished product.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP is an unofficial project: not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by WHOOP, Inc. \"WHOOP\" is their trademark, used only to name the hardware NOOP works with.": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"NOOP is free and always will be, nothing is locked. It cost real money and a lot of unpaid hours to build, and there's a Windows app, an Android app and an iOS app I want to ship next. If it's useful to you and you want to help with the development and testing costs, even a few quid in crypto genuinely keeps it moving, and honestly it keeps me motivated to keep building.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP is free and always will be, nothing is locked. It cost real money and a lot of unpaid hours to build, and there's a Windows app, an Android app and an iOS app I want to ship next. If it's useful to you and you want to help with the development and testing costs, even a few quid in crypto genuinely keeps it moving, and honestly it keeps me motivated to keep building."}}}},"NOOP is free and provided \"as is\", with no warranty. Liability is limited to the maximum extent the law that applies to you allows, and nothing here removes protections your local law won't let us remove.": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"NOOP is not a medical device and this is not an ECG test. Anything the strap reports here — including any heart-rhythm classification it happens to send — is unvalidated instrumentation for protocol research, not a measurement and not a diagnosis. Never use it to make a decision about your health. If you have symptoms or are worried about your heart, talk to a doctor.": {"comment": "MEDICAL SAFETY COPY — needs a native speaker, not a machine translation. Deliberately left untranslated: a disclaimer that drifts in meaning is worse than one shown in English. Until a human translates it, the absent localizations make the runtime fall back to this English source text, which is correct and complete. Keep every element when translating: not a medical device, not a diagnosis, and the instruction to see a doctor.","shouldTranslate": false,"localizations": {}},"NOOP is not a medical device and this is not an ECG test. It asks your MG to start its ECG subsystem and logs whatever comes back — unvalidated instrumentation for protocol research, never a measurement or a diagnosis, including any heart-rhythm classification the strap happens to send. Don't use it to make a health decision; see a doctor if you have symptoms.\n\nHold the two indents on the clasp with the fingers of your other hand for the whole capture. The MG measures across your wrist AND that clasp, so until you hold it the circuit is open, the strap has nothing to record, and you would see zero packets whatever the firmware did.\n\nNobody has confirmed a strap honours these commands, so the likely outcome is that nothing happens. Everything here is reversible: “Stop” turns the streams back off. Results land in the strap log.": {"comment": "MEDICAL SAFETY COPY — needs a native speaker, not a machine translation. Deliberately left untranslated: a disclaimer that drifts in meaning is worse than one shown in English. Until a human translates it, the absent localizations make the runtime fall back to this English source text, which is correct and complete. Keep every element when translating: not a medical device, not a diagnosis, and the instruction to see a doctor. The middle paragraph is a RUN INSTRUCTION, not a disclaimer: without the clasp held the electrode circuit is open and the capture returns zero packets for a reason that has nothing to do with the firmware, so a translation that loses it produces false negatives in the very reports #891 is asking people for.","shouldTranslate": false,"localizations": {}},"NOOP is not a medical device. It is for informational and personal-insight purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Talk to a clinician for medical advice.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP is not a medical device. It is for informational and personal-insight purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Talk to a clinician for medical advice."}}}},"NOOP is opening your on-device data. Your paired bands will appear here in a moment.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP looks for known notification apps on %@: Mail, Outlook, WhatsApp, Teams, Messages, Slack and similar. Install one and it'll appear here automatically.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP looks for machines that broadcast the standard Bluetooth Fitness Machine service.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP never decides whether a value is \"normal,\" \"high,\" or \"low.\" Any reference range shown is exactly what you typed from your own report.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP never fills this in. It only shows back exactly what you type from your own report.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP never makes up a number. When it can't compute one honestly it tells you what's missing and what to do, rather than showing a fake value.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP never shows you a number it had to make up. If a score isn't ready, it tells you why and what to do next. Everything here runs on your device, from your strap.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth, no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth, no WHOOP app, no cloud."}}}},"NOOP pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth: no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP picks the best-sourced number and shows you where each came from. It's for wellness and curiosity. It doesn't diagnose or replace medical advice.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP picks your main sleep as your longest real block, and (once it has learned your usual hours) the one nearest your normal sleep time. Everything else that day is a nap. You can always edit bed and wake times.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP reads live heart rate on bands that don't require pairing. Newer bands need an auth handshake we can't do yet.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP reads live heart rate when the band exposes it. Some bands need a pairing we can't do yet. If so, we'll say so honestly.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP reads your Apple Watch data through Apple Health, on your phone, nothing leaves the device. You choose exactly what to share.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP reads your heart rate, HRV, resting heart rate, sleep, steps, energy and VO₂ max from Apple Health to compute your scores. It all stays on this iPhone, and you pick exactly what to share on the next screen.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP scores your charge, effort and rest itself: on-device, no cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP scores your recovery, strain and sleep itself, on-device, no cloud.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP scores your recovery, strain and sleep itself, on-device, no cloud."}}}},"NOOP shows the %@ reading because it %@ for this metric: a higher-trust source here, not a verdict that the others are wrong.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "NOOP shows the %1$@ reading because it %2$@ for this metric, a higher-trust source here, not a verdict that the others are wrong."}}}},"NOOP stores and lines up the numbers you enter yourself. It does not test you, read your results, give medical advice, or diagnose anything.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP stores this key only on this device, in the same place it stores your paired bands.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP talks to your strap directly over Bluetooth Low Energy. There's no server in the middle. The connection is local, and so is every reading it pulls in.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP talks to your strap's firmware over an unofficial, independently-mapped protocol. There is a residual risk to the device, its data, and its connection to official services. You assume that risk.": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"NOOP taps your strap so an alert lands on your wrist instead of your screen. No need to reach for it. Everything stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP will install its own key on the ring and become its owner. The Oura app will no longer control this ring. This is intended and it cannot be undone from NOOP.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP will look for it nearby.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP will re-learn your baseline from tonight's data onward. Your history is kept, and it takes a few nights to settle.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP's own Charge, Effort and Rest, computed on your device from published methods.": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP's primary, fully-supported band": {"localizations": {}},"NOOP, all your data, none of the cloud.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP, all your data, none of the cloud."}}}},"NOOP-computed": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "NOOP-computed"}}}},"NOOP: all your data, none of the cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"Name": {"localizations": {}},"Name & confirm": {"localizations": {}},"Nap ended": {"localizations": {}},"Nap started": {"localizations": {}},"Nap(s)": {"localizations": {}},"Naps": {"localizations": {}},"Navy": {"localizations": {}},"Needs at least 14 days of history. When two or more signals drift together you get a banner on the dashboard and a notification, at most once a day.": {"localizations": {}},"Needs interval frames": {"localizations": {}},"Needs more data": {"localizations": {}},"Needs the full encrypted bond: close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first (a live-HR-only link can't carry the unlock).": {"localizations": {}},"Needs the strap": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Needs the strap"}}}},"Needs the strap. No data for today. Was your strap worn and connected overnight?": {"localizations": {}},"Neutral": {"localizations": {}},"Never": {"localizations": {}},"New data added": {"localizations": {}},"New here?": {"localizations": {}},"New release notes and fresh data will land here.": {"localizations": {}},"New strap name": {"localizations": {}},"Newer WHOOP band, experimental in NOOP": {"localizations": {}},"Next day": {"localizations": {}},"Next morning": {"localizations": {}},"Next night": {"localizations": {}},"Next week": {"localizations": {}},"Night": {"localizations": {}},"Night detail": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Night detail"}}}},"Nights": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Nights"}}}},"No": {"localizations": {}},"No %@ here": {"localizations": {}},"No Charge banked today, so your band takes a careful middle course: %lld–%lld bpm.": {"localizations": {}},"No Charge breakdown yet": {"localizations": {}},"No Data": {"localizations": {}},"No HRV value": {"localizations": {}},"No RMSSD · not enough R-R data": {"localizations": {}},"No SpO₂ import or Health value": {"localizations": {}},"No WHOOP? You can still continue. Pair a heart-rate strap (Polar, Wahoo, Coospo, Garmin HRM…) or a gym machine under Devices, or import from WHOOP, Apple Health, Oura, Fitbit, Garmin and more under Data Sources. You can do either any time.": {"localizations": {}},"No account, no cloud, no sync. NOOP talks only to your strap and keeps everything local. Your data is yours alone.": {"localizations": {}},"No active stream": {"localizations": {}},"No backup yet.": {"localizations": {}},"No backups found": {"localizations": {}},"No biometrics yet. Import your WHOOP export (and Apple Health if you have it) in Data Sources to fill this in.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No biometrics yet. Import your WHOOP export (and Apple Health if you have it) in Data Sources to fill this in."}}}},"No caffeine logged. Log an intake to see an estimate.": {"localizations": {}},"No cardio load yet. Effort builds once your heart rate climbs into your effort zone (around 50% of your heart-rate reserve). A calm day honestly reads near zero.": {"localizations": {}},"No chest strap? No problem. NOOP can run off only your Apple Watch. It reads your watch's data through Apple Health and works out your Charge, Rest, Effort and Fitness Age right here on your phone. Everything stays on the device.": {"localizations": {}},"No clear pattern": {"localizations": {}},"No clear reading yet": {"localizations": {}},"No completed offload yet": {"localizations": {}},"No data": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No data"}}}},"No data for these metrics in %@. Widen the range or pick metrics you've logged.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No data for these metrics in %@. Widen the range or pick metrics you've logged."}}}},"No data for today. Was your strap worn and connected overnight?": {"localizations": {}},"No days yet where both NOOP and your phone counted steps. Once your phone logs a few days alongside the strap, they'll appear here so you can see how close the estimate is.": {"localizations": {}},"No drinks logged yet. Tap Sip, Cup or Bottle to start.": {"localizations": {}},"No earlier night stored yet. Earlier nights sync in the morning.": {"localizations": {}},"No extra tonight. Your %@ forecast stays where it is.": {"localizations": {}},"No folder chosen yet. Pick one your cloud app already syncs, or any local folder.": {"localizations": {}},"No heart rate for this day": {"localizations": {}},"No heart-rate detail for this night": {"localizations": {}},"No history yet.": {"localizations": {}},"No iOS diagnostics available.": {"localizations": {}},"No intraday stress data yet today.": {"localizations": {}},"No live heart rate yet. Open Live to pair your strap.": {"localizations": {}},"No live reading. Coaching is paused until the strap comes back.": {"localizations": {}},"No live reading. Coaching is paused.": {"localizations": {}},"No live stream.": {"localizations": {}},"No match. Add it as a custom marker below.": {"localizations": {}},"No metrics yet. Import your Whoop export or wear the strap to begin.": {"localizations": {}},"No motion synced yet": {"localizations": {}},"No movement detail for this night": {"localizations": {}},"No movement detail recorded for this night": {"localizations": {}},"No naps recorded for this day.": {"localizations": {}},"No new nights from your strap for %lld days. Check it's connected and saving data.": {"localizations": {}},"No nightly skin-temp value": {"localizations": {}},"No nights here yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see every night, your sleep stages and trends straight away. Or open Intelligence to see last night computed from the strap after you wear it to bed.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No nights here yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see every night, your sleep stages and trends straight away. Or open Intelligence to see last night computed from the strap after you wear it to bed."}}}},"No nights with sleep data yet. Your ledger fills in as you wear the strap to bed.": {"localizations": {}},"No numeric readings yet.": {"localizations": {}},"No on-device store yet.": {"localizations": {}},"No overlap yet between this marker and %@. Log a few more readings (and keep wearing your strap).": {"localizations": {}},"No photo → person.crop.circle fallback": {"localizations": {}},"No profile photo set": {"localizations": {}},"No raw capture has been recorded yet this session.": {"localizations": {}},"No readings recorded.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No readings recorded."}}}},"No readings this week": {"localizations": {}},"No readings this week yet": {"localizations": {}},"No respiratory-rate value": {"localizations": {}},"No resting HR value": {"localizations": {}},"No scheduled exports to clear.": {"localizations": {}},"No scored days in this window. Widen the range or import more history.": {"localizations": {}},"No sleep tracked last night": {"localizations": {}},"No sources yet": {"localizations": {}},"No stage data recorded for this night.": {"localizations": {}},"No strap connected": {"localizations": {}},"No strap connected. Put your WHOOP nearby and tap Re-scan to pair.": {"localizations": {}},"No stress history yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see it.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No stress history yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see it."}}}},"No supported apps found": {"localizations": {}},"No usable activity found. Point at a .gpx, .tcx or .fit workout file.": {"localizations": {}},"No usable rows found. Check the file has a date column (yyyy-MM-dd) and daily totals.": {"localizations": {}},"No warranty; liability limited": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"No workout, stress, recovery, sleep, HRV, resting-HR, strain, respiratory-rate or skin-temp readings fell inside %@. Wear your strap a few more days, or pick a wider range, then export again.": {"localizations": {}},"No workouts found. Point at a Hevy CSV export or a Liftosaur JSON export.": {"localizations": {}},"No workouts yet": {"localizations": {}},"No workouts yet. They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import in Data Sources to bring them in, or add one you tracked elsewhere.": {"localizations": {}},"No workouts yet. They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import in Data Sources to bring them in.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "No workouts yet. They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import in Data Sources to bring them in."}}}},"Non-binary": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Non-binary"}}}},"None — silence, start to finish": {"localizations": {}},"Noon": {"localizations": {}},"Normalized": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Normalized"}}}},"Normalized overlay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Normalized overlay"}}}},"Not a medical device, not medical advice": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"Not a workout": {"localizations": {}},"Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to WHOOP. Interoperability software for hardware you own and your own data. Use it only with a device you own, and not in breach of any agreement that applies to you. Not a medical device.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to WHOOP. Interoperability software for hardware you own and your own data. Use it only with a device you own, and not in breach of any agreement that applies to you. Not a medical device."}}}},"Not available": {"localizations": {}},"Not calibrated": {"localizations": {}},"Not calibrated yet": {"localizations": {}},"Not connected": {"localizations": {}},"Not connected. Open Live to pair.": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough clean beat data to lock a pace today. Try again rested, sitting still with the strap snug. For now we'll pace you at 5.5 br/min (coherence).": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough clean beats. Sit still and try again.": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough clean beats. Sit still and try again. %lld of %lld beats survived filtering (need %lld).": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Not enough clean beats, sit still and try again. %1$lld of %2$lld beats survived filtering (need %3$lld)."}}}},"Not enough data": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough data for this window.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not enough data for this window."}}}},"Not enough data in this range yet": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough data yet": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough nights yet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not enough nights yet."}}}},"Not enough overlap between your journal answers and %@ to measure an effect yet. Keep logging. Effects need days both with and without each behaviour.": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough overlap between your journal answers and %@ yet. Keep logging. Each behaviour needs days both with and without it before NOOP can read its effect.": {"localizations": {}},"Not enough overlapping days between these metrics in %@. Widen the range.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not enough overlapping days between these metrics in %@. Widen the range."}}}},"Not enough overlapping history to correlate your metrics yet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not enough overlapping history to correlate your metrics yet."}}}},"Not enough recent days to chart a trend yet. Import a history or keep wearing your strap.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not enough recent days to chart a trend yet. Import a history or keep wearing your strap."}}}},"Not now": {"localizations": {}},"Not recording": {"localizations": {}},"Not recording. Strap not connected. Tap to connect.": {"localizations": {}},"Not set": {"localizations": {}},"Not showing up? Make sure you reset the ring in the Oura app and force-quit it, then tap Rescan. A ring still owned by Oura will not list here.": {"localizations": {}},"Not showing up? The official WHOOP app may still be holding it. Force-quit that app, then tap Rescan.": {"localizations": {}},"Not synced yet": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Not synced yet"}}}},"Note (optional)": {"localizations": {}},"Notes": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing here yet. Tap Enable Apple Health above to read your data live, or import a Health export .zip in Data Sources.": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing here yet. This sideloaded install can't read Apple Health directly. Import a Health export .zip in Data Sources, or turn on Shortcuts Export to bring your strap data into Health.": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing hidden": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing imported": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing imported yet. In Data Sources, choose your Mi Fitness export (a .zip of the Mi Fitness app folder from the Files app) to bring in your steps, heart rate, sleep stages, SpO₂ and stress.": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing imported yet. On an iPhone: Health app, tap your photo, Export All Health Data, then import the .zip here in Data Sources.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Nothing imported yet. On an iPhone: Health app, tap your photo, Export All Health Data, then import the .zip here in Data Sources."}}}},"Nothing in the catalog moves clearly with %@ over this window. Widen the range to surface relationships.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Nothing in the catalog moves clearly with %@ over this window. Widen the range to surface relationships."}}}},"Nothing leaves your %@": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing notable": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing offloaded for this window yet.": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing selected yet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Nothing selected yet."}}}},"Nothing to export": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing to fuse yet": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing to reclaim right now. NOOP already cleans up import scratch space automatically.": {"localizations": {}},"Nothing's flagging. Train to feel - your body's holding steady.": {"localizations": {}},"Notifications": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Notifications"}}}},"Notifications are off, so this can't buzz yet. Turn on the master switch in Notifications to let it through.": {"localizations": {}},"Notify on low and full battery": {"localizations": {}},"Notify when optimal strain is reached": {"localizations": {}},"Nov": {"localizations": {}},"Now": {"localizations": {}},"Nutrition": {"localizations": {}},"Nutrition (.csv)": {"localizations": {}},"OFFLINE": {"localizations": {}},"OK": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "OK"}}}},"ON": {"localizations": {}},"OPTIMAL": {"localizations": {}},"Oct": {"localizations": {}},"Off": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Off"}}}},"Off baseline": {"localizations": {}},"Off wrist": {"localizations": {}},"Off, the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Off, the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics."}}}},"Off: only your core metrics are shared, not your patterns or Lab Book.": {"localizations": {}},"Off: the coach answers generally and sends none of your metrics.": {"localizations": {}},"Offers to save a workout when it spots sustained elevated heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Offline": {"localizations": {}},"Okay": {"localizations": {}},"Older backups beyond this many are pruned, oldest first (≈ that many days). If data ever corrupts, restore the newest.": {"localizations": {}},"Older scheduled exports beyond this many are pruned automatically, oldest first.": {"localizations": {}},"On %@": {"localizations": {}},"On a 5/MG connection NOOP will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "On a 5/MG connection NOOP will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0."}}}},"On a beta version of iOS, things can break that work on the release build.": {"localizations": {}},"On iPhone this is a sideloaded build. Re-sign it about every 7 days on a free Apple ID (longer on a paid account). After your phone reboots, unlock it once so NOOP can read and sync its data.": {"localizations": {}},"On iPhone this is best-effort (iOS decides when background tasks run). Everything stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"On target": {"localizations": {}},"On the days your phone also counted steps, NOOP learns how much your motion maps to steps, then applies that to the strap-only days. The more matching days it has, the more it trusts the estimate.": {"localizations": {}},"On wrist": {"localizations": {}},"On, your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "On, your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching."}}}},"On-device": {"localizations": {}},"On-device estimate (approximate), not a diagnosis.": {"localizations": {}},"On-device footprint": {"localizations": {}},"On: a short summary of your strongest patterns and logged health numbers is added. Summaries only, never raw readings.": {"localizations": {}},"On: your charge, rest, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching.": {"localizations": {}},"Once NOOP has 14 nights of history, in-range compares each vital to your own baseline (approximate, not medical advice); until then, typical adult ranges apply.": {"localizations": {}},"Once this week has a day or two of data, your week-in-review appears here.": {"localizations": {}},"One of your signals is flagging. You can train, but keep it controlled and bank the recovery.": {"localizations": {}},"One reading so far: %@ %@. Log a few more to see a trend.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "One reading so far: %1$@ %2$@. Log a few more to see a trend."}}}},"Only buzz when worn": {"localizations": {}},"Only during active hours": {"localizations": {}},"Only if your server requires one": {"localizations": {}},"Only nudge during your active hours.": {"localizations": {}},"Only when worn": {"localizations": {}},"Open": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Open"}}}},"Open Backup and Sync to a folder": {"localizations": {}},"Open NOOP first so it can reach your strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Open NOOP near your strap and let it catch up (a full history sync can take a while on first run). Once a day or two of motion lands, your step estimate and the calibration below will start to fill in.": {"localizations": {}},"Open NOOP on your iPhone to sync": {"localizations": {}},"Open Rhythm": {"localizations": {}},"Open Test Centre": {"localizations": {}},"Open Test Centre to report a bug": {"localizations": {}},"Open journal": {"localizations": {}},"Open live view": {"localizations": {}},"Open the official Oura app and remove this ring (Oura calls it \"factory reset\" or \"unpair and reset\"). This wipes the ring's owner so NOOP can take it over.": {"localizations": {}},"Open-source BLE reverse-engineering work. Thank you.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Open-source BLE reverse-engineering work. Thank you."}}}},"Opens the Apple Watch setup and Health permission": {"localizations": {}},"Opens the Devices screen, where you pair and switch bands.": {"localizations": {}},"Opens the GitHub releases page in your browser. NOOP itself makes no network connections, the macOS sandbox has no network entitlement.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Opens the GitHub releases page in your browser. NOOP itself makes no network connections, the macOS sandbox has no network entitlement."}}}},"Opens the full-day heart rate timeline": {"localizations": {}},"Opens workout detail": {"localizations": {}},"Optical block experiment": {"localizations": {}},"Optimal": {"localizations": {}},"Optimal strain reached": {"localizations": {}},"Optional": {"localizations": {}},"Optional note": {"localizations": {}},"Optional trackers, off by default. Turn them on to add their cards. Everything stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Optional, on-device reads from your nightly signals. Each is off by default: for awareness only, never a diagnosis.": {"localizations": {}},"Optional. Add a photo for the avatar in the top-left. Stored only on %@. NOOP is offline, so it's never uploaded.": {"localizations": {}},"Optional. Add a photo for your avatar. It stays on %@ and is never uploaded.": {"localizations": {}},"Optional. Stored only on this device.": {"localizations": {}},"Optional: VO₂max builds from about 4 nights of heart rate; a waist makes it more accurate. The Fitness Age itself doesn't need it. Measure around your middle, at the navel.": {"localizations": {}},"Optional: import now, or continue and return to Data Sources later.": {"localizations": {}},"Other": {"localizations": {}},"Other metrics (R-R, frames, battery, history) need a full sync.": {"localizations": {}},"Other sources don’t offload raw per-second data on-device.": {"localizations": {}},"Oura / Fitbit / Garmin export": {"localizations": {}},"Oura Readiness / Sleep score": {"localizations": {}},"Oura ring": {"localizations": {}},"Oura's own Readiness and Sleep scores. NOOP does not copy them. It computes its own.": {"localizations": {}},"Outcome": {"localizations": {}},"Outcome metric": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Outcome metric"}}}},"Outside range": {"localizations": {}},"Over your readings, %@ and %@ move largely independently. No clear relationship.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Over your readings, %1$@ and %2$@ move largely independently. No clear relationship."}}}},"Overlay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Overlay"}}}},"Overlay 2–4 signals": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Overlay 2–4 signals"}}}},"Overlay signals, draw conclusions.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Overlay signals, draw conclusions."}}}},"Overnight computed": {"localizations": {}},"Overnight only": {"localizations": {}},"Overnight sleep staging, resting heart rate, skin-temperature trend, motion and battery, read straight off the ring.": {"localizations": {}},"Override the automatic fit with your own steps-per-motion value. Useful if your phone has no step history to learn from, or the estimate runs consistently high or low. Set it back to auto by dragging to the far left.": {"localizations": {}},"Own your data, offline": {"localizations": {}},"Owned": {"localizations": {}},"PAIRED": {"localizations": {}},"PAUSED": {"localizations": {}},"PEAK": {"localizations": {}},"POWER": {"localizations": {}},"PROVENANCE": {"localizations": {}},"Pace": {"localizations": {}},"Pair and manage the bands NOOP reads from.": {"localizations": {}},"Paired": {"localizations": {}},"Paired locally. NOOP owns this ring while it holds the key. If you reset it again or set it up in the Oura app, NOOP no longer owns it and you would re-add it to take it over.": {"localizations": {}},"Paired · idle": {"localizations": {}},"Pairing help: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Pairing…": {"localizations": {}},"Pairs directly with your strap over Bluetooth: no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {"localizations": {}},"Parasympathetic (rest) band of your HRV.": {"localizations": {}},"Partial": {"localizations": {}},"Passive": {"localizations": {}},"Paste your %@ API key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Paste your %@ API key"}}}},"Patterns in your own data: association, not cause.": {"localizations": {}},"Pause": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Pause"}}}},"Pause HRV capture": {"localizations": {}},"Paused": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Paused"}}}},"Peak": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Peak"}}}},"Peak %lld bpm": {"localizations": {}},"Peak heart rate": {"localizations": {}},"Peaked": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Peaked"}}}},"Pearson r": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Pearson r"}}}},"Pearson r over the visible window · |r| ≥ 0.30, n ≥ 10": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Pearson r over the visible window · |r| ≥ 0.30, n ≥ 10"}}}},"Pearson r · %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Pearson r · %@"}}}},"Per extra %@": {"localizations": {}},"Per night, trailing 30 days": {"localizations": {}},"Per-night need": {"localizations": {}},"Per-night sleep balance: %lld nights, net %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Per-night sleep balance: %1$lld nights, net %2$@"}}}},"Personal Experiment": {"localizations": {}},"Personal curve · prior-shrunk": {"localizations": {}},"Phase 1": {"localizations": {}},"Phone": {"localizations": {}},"Pick %@": {"localizations": {}},"Pick a new active strap": {"localizations": {}},"Pick a sport. NOOP records HR, peak, average and effort from the live feed.": {"localizations": {}},"Pick a wearable signal (resting HR, HRV, sleep, Charge, weight…) to line it up against this marker. NOOP averages the signal over the %@ before each reading.": {"localizations": {}},"Pick one behaviour you log, one outcome, and a short window. NOOP compares the days you log the behaviour against your behaviour-free days before the start.": {"localizations": {}},"Pick the ring": {"localizations": {}},"Pick when the nap started and ended. NOOP stages it from your data as its own session, separate from the night's sleep.": {"localizations": {}},"Pick which apps reach your wrist in Settings → Notifications.": {"localizations": {}},"Pick your device": {"localizations": {}},"Pick your strap below, then tap Scan. NOOP will find it.": {"localizations": {}},"Picked as your main sleep because it started near your usual sleep time.": {"localizations": {}},"Picked as your main sleep because it was your longest block (%@), near your usual bedtime.": {"localizations": {}},"Picked as your main sleep because it was your longest block (%@).": {"localizations": {}},"Pinch to zoom · drag to pan": {"localizations": {}},"Plan a trip or shift": {"localizations": {}},"Plan · %lld-day shift": {"localizations": {}},"Please confirm each of these:": {"localizations": {}},"Please read and accept the points below.": {"localizations": {}},"Please read the points below, then confirm each statement.": {"localizations": {}},"Points": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Points"}}}},"Polar, Wahoo, Coospo, Garmin HRM, Amazfit Helio broadcast": {"localizations": {}},"Poor": {"localizations": {}},"Posts after your strap syncs and NOOP scores the day — not the exact second you cross it. At most once per day.": {"localizations": {}},"Power saving mode": {"localizations": {}},"Power users only.": {"localizations": {}},"Powers Charge, Effort, Rest and Sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Powers Charge, Effort, Rest, Sleep + Health Monitor": {"localizations": {}},"Powers Effort now; Charge and Rest once enough nights and decode are confirmed": {"localizations": {}},"Powers Rest, Effort, Fitness Age and steps, plus Charge once recovery calibrates": {"localizations": {}},"Powers the live console + Effort. No Charge, Rest or Sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Preparing…": {"localizations": {}},"Presence automation: set a Focus, pause media, set away…": {"localizations": {}},"Preview": {"localizations": {}},"Preview dose": {"localizations": {}},"Previous day": {"localizations": {}},"Previous night": {"localizations": {}},"Previous week": {"localizations": {}},"Previously paired but not currently connected. Re-scan to reconnect.": {"localizations": {}},"Primed": {"localizations": {}},"Probably not illness": {"localizations": {}},"Profile": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Profile"}}}},"Profile and settings": {"localizations": {}},"Profile photo": {"localizations": {}},"Project home & source": {"localizations": {}},"Project home and source code on GitHub": {"localizations": {}},"Proof that the console is current": {"localizations": {}},"Protein": {"localizations": {}},"Provenance": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Provenance"}}}},"Provider": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Provider"}}}},"Pulling your strap's stored history. This drains oldest-first; a deep backlog now continues automatically across passes instead of waiting between syncs.": {"localizations": {}},"Pulls your strap's stored history immediately, without waiting for the next automatic sync.": {"localizations": {}},"Push": {"localizations": {}},"Put the band into pairing mode, on your wrist and awake.": {"localizations": {}},"Put the strap on first. The deep stream is on-wrist only.": {"localizations": {}},"Put your WHOOP 4.0 on your wrist and make sure it's awake.": {"localizations": {}},"Put your strap on": {"localizations": {}},"QUICK ACTIONS": {"localizations": {}},"Question": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Question"}}}},"Questions, feedback, bugs, %@": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Questions, feedback, bugs, %@"}}}},"Questions, feedback, bugs: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Quick actions": {"localizations": {}},"Quick sweep · ~7 min": {"localizations": {}},"Quiet hours": {"localizations": {}},"Quiet hours end": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Quiet hours end"}}}},"Quiet hours start": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Quiet hours start"}}}},"R-R intervals": {"localizations": {}},"RECORDING": {"localizations": {}},"RECORDING WORKOUT": {"localizations": {}},"RECOVERY": {"localizations": {}},"RECOVERY VITALS": {"localizations": {}},"REL.": {"localizations": {}},"REM": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "REM"}}}},"REM Sleep": {"localizations": {}},"REM sleep": {"localizations": {}},"REST": {"localizations": {}},"RESTING HR + SLEEP + HRV": {"localizations": {}},"RESTORATIVE SLEEP": {"localizations": {}},"RHR": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "RHR"}}}},"RMSSD": {"localizations": {}},"RMSSD %.0f ms now vs your ~%.0f ms baseline (estimate from PPG-derived R-R).": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "RMSSD %1$.0f ms now vs your ~%2$.0f ms baseline (estimate from PPG-derived R-R)."}}}},"RMSSD %@": {"localizations": {}},"RMSSD %lld milliseconds": {"localizations": {}},"RMSSD %lld ms": {"localizations": {}},"ROUND": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "ROUND"}}}},"RSA RESPONSE BY PACE": {"localizations": {}},"RSA response by pace": {"localizations": {}},"Radio connected, stream not yet trusted.": {"localizations": {}},"Range": {"localizations": {}},"Ranked · your data": {"localizations": {}},"Ranked, lag-aware: which of your habits actually move your Charge, plus your personal alcohol/caffeine dose-response.": {"localizations": {}},"Raw counts only — needs an import": {"extractionState": "manual","localizations": {}},"Raw on-device stages. This split is the ring's raw on-device classification read over Bluetooth, not the adjusted stages the Oura app shows. Expect more awake and less deep or REM here than in the Oura app for the same night.": {"localizations": {}},"Raw · per second": {"localizations": {}},"Re-anchors every baseline that feeds Charge to your recent nights. No stored day is deleted.": {"localizations": {}},"Re-label as": {"localizations": {}},"Re-nudge every": {"localizations": {}},"Re-scan": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Re-scan"}}}},"Re-share your live strap heart rate over Bluetooth as a standard heart-rate sensor, so a gym treadmill, bike, Zwift, Peloton or any fitness app nearby can read it. Local Bluetooth only. Nothing leaves %@. Off by default.": {"localizations": {}},"React when the strap comes off or goes on. Note: macOS reserves true auto-UNLOCK for Apple Watch, so this can lock, not unlock.": {"localizations": {}},"React when the strap comes off or goes on. Run a Shortcut to set a Focus, pause media, mark yourself away.": {"localizations": {}},"Read the full Lab Book note": {"localizations": {}},"Read the full note": {"localizations": {}},"Read your heart rate, HRV, blood oxygen, respiratory rate, sleep, steps and energy straight from Apple Health, and write NOOP's strap data back: sleep with full stages, continuous heart rate, workouts, and nightly vitals. Everything stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Read your heart rate, HRV, blood oxygen, respiratory rate, sleep, steps and energy straight from Apple Health, and write NOOP's strap-derived metrics back. Everything stays on %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Readiness": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Readiness"}}}},"Readiness: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Readiness: %@. %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Readiness: %1$@. %2$@"}}}},"Reading": {"localizations": {}},"Reading complete": {"localizations": {}},"Reading incomplete": {"localizations": {}},"Reading your %@…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reading your %@…"}}}},"Reading your Apple Health history…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reading your Apple Health history…"}}}},"Reading your Fitness Age…": {"localizations": {}},"Reading your Mi Band history…": {"localizations": {}},"Reading your Vitality…": {"localizations": {}},"Reading your heart-rate variability and resting heart rate…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reading your heart-rate variability and resting heart rate…"}}}},"Reading today's heart rate…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reading today's heart rate…"}}}},"Reading your history…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reading your history…"}}}},"Reading your journal and outcomes…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reading your journal and outcomes…"}}}},"Reading your logbook…": {"localizations": {}},"Reading your sources…": {"localizations": {}},"Readings": {"localizations": {}},"Reads a coarse menstrual-cycle phase from your nightly skin temperature, entirely on %@. Awareness only: not contraception, not a fertility predictor, not a medical service. The card appears in Health.": {"localizations": {}},"Ready": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Ready"}}}},"Ready for a marked effort.": {"localizations": {}},"Ready to breathe": {"localizations": {}},"Ready to connect your watch?": {"localizations": {}},"Ready to scan": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Ready to scan"}}}},"Ready to sync": {"localizations": {}},"Ready-made actions": {"localizations": {}},"Reboot probe (4.0 RE)…": {"localizations": {}},"Recalibrate": {"localizations": {}},"Recalibrate Charge baseline": {"localizations": {}},"Recalibrate your Charge baseline?": {"localizations": {}},"Recent": {"localizations": {}},"Recent intervals: %@ ms": {"localizations": {}},"Recent moments": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Recent moments"}}}},"Recharge your WHOOP before tonight.": {"localizations": {}},"Reclaimable": {"localizations": {}},"Reclaimed %@.": {"localizations": {}},"Recompute": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Recompute"}}}},"Reconnect help: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Reconnect to pull the latest.": {"localizations": {}},"Reconnects this run": {"localizations": {}},"Record a timestamped moment (and buzz the strap if it's connected).": {"localizations": {}},"Record a timestamped moment in NOOP.": {"localizations": {}},"Record or inspect the current stream": {"localizations": {}},"Record puffin frames to a file": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Record puffin frames to a file"}}}},"Recorded on device": {"localizations": {}},"Recording": {"localizations": {}},"Recording status, not shown for a past day": {"localizations": {}},"Recording. Your strap is connected and saving data.": {"localizations": {}},"Records & sources": {"localizations": {}},"Records a live machine workout, Effort-scored from HR when the machine reports it": {"localizations": {}},"Recovery": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Recovery"}}}},"Recovery / Charge": {"localizations": {}},"Recovery Trend": {"localizations": {}},"Recovery takes about a week": {"localizations": {}},"Recovery weighs your HRV against your personal baseline (~60%), resting heart rate (~20%), sleep performance (~15%) and respiration (~5%). Day strain is a 0–21 cardiovascular load from time in heart-rate zones. Sleep is staged from movement and heart rate. Everything is computed here from the strap's raw data, it works for any day NOOP collected raw streams.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Recovery weighs your HRV against your personal baseline (~60%), resting heart rate (~20%), sleep performance (~15%) and respiration (~5%). Day strain is a 0–21 cardiovascular load from time in heart-rate zones. Sleep is staged from movement and heart rate. Everything is computed here from the strap's raw data, it works for any day NOOP collected raw streams."}}}},"Recovery, NOOP's Charge score, is led by your heart-rate variability measured against your own personal baseline. A chest strap streams beat-to-beat data densely all night, so it can learn that baseline fast. An Apple Watch instead samples HRV, a handful of readings through the day plus overnight, so the signal is real but sparser.": {"localizations": {}},"Recovery, Test Centre, experimental probes, and backup. Tucked away to keep the everyday screen tidy.": {"localizations": {}},"Recovery, strain and sleep in one glance": {"localizations": {}},"Reference range from my report (optional)": {"localizations": {}},"Reference range from your own report, optional": {"localizations": {}},"Refresh": {"localizations": {}},"Refresh Fitness Age": {"localizations": {}},"Refresh models": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Refresh models"}}}},"Refresh models from provider": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Refresh models from provider"}}}},"Refresh strap battery and connection state.": {"localizations": {}},"Relax": {"localizations": {}},"Relax 4-6": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Relax 4-6"}}}},"Relaxation guidance from your own numbers: not a health alert, and not a diagnosis. Trends matter more than any single number.": {"localizations": {}},"Release notes": {"localizations": {}},"Remaining": {"localizations": {}},"Remind me to wind down": {"localizations": {}},"Remove": {"localizations": {}},"Remove %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Remove %@"}}}},"Remove %@? NOOP will stop connecting to it. Its recorded data is kept and you can re-add it any time.": {"localizations": {}},"Remove Apple Health imported data": {"localizations": {}},"Remove Apple Health imported data?": {"localizations": {}},"Remove a question to tidy your list. Custom questions are deleted; the built-in ones are hidden and can be restored below.": {"localizations": {}},"Remove caffeine intake at %@": {"localizations": {}},"Remove imported data": {"localizations": {}},"Remove photo": {"localizations": {}},"Remove this device?": {"localizations": {}},"Removed": {"localizations": {}},"Removed %lld file(s).": {"localizations": {}},"Removed all Apple Health imported data.": {"localizations": {}},"Removed · data kept": {"localizations": {}},"Removes this recorded sleep and recomputes the day without it. This can't be undone.": {"localizations": {}},"Removing…": {"localizations": {}},"Rename": {"localizations": {}},"Rename device": {"localizations": {}},"Rename item": {"localizations": {}},"Rename…": {"localizations": {}},"Replace all current data with the backup %@? This cannot be undone.": {"localizations": {}},"Replace all current data with the backup from %@? This cannot be undone.": {"localizations": {}},"Replace all data": {"localizations": {}},"Replace this device's data with one of the backups in your folder. This overwrites current data, so back up first if you're unsure.": {"localizations": {}},"Replaces the Today tab with the prototype redesign. Turn it off any time to return to the classic dashboard. Reads the same live data from your strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Report": {"localizations": {}},"Report a %@ bug": {"localizations": {}},"Report a bug with my log": {"localizations": {}},"Rescan": {"localizations": {}},"Research-grade alternatives / precision tweaks. Opt-in, off by default, non-clinical.": {"localizations": {}},"Reset": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reset"}}}},"Reset API key": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reset API key"}}}},"Reset Key Metrics to default": {"localizations": {}},"Reset This Layout": {"localizations": {}},"Reset coach instructions to default": {"localizations": {}},"Reset dashboard cards to default": {"localizations": {}},"Reset it in the Oura app first, then scan.": {"localizations": {}},"Reset it in the Oura app first.": {"localizations": {}},"Reset key": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reset key"}}}},"Reset to default": {"localizations": {}},"Resonance": {"localizations": {}},"Resp Rate": {"localizations": {}},"Respect quiet hours": {"localizations": {}},"Respiration": {"localizations": {}},"Respiratory": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Respiratory"}}}},"Respiratory Rate": {"localizations": {}},"Respiratory rate": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Respiratory rate"}}}},"Rest": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Rest"}}}},"Rest HR": {"localizations": {}},"Rest baseline": {"localizations": {}},"Rest quality": {"localizations": {}},"Rest up": {"localizations": {}},"Rest ↔ Charge": {"localizations": {}},"Rest: how restorative was your sleep?": {"localizations": {}},"Restart": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Restart"}}}},"Restart %@? It disconnects for about 30 seconds while it reboots, then reconnects on its own. Your recorded data is kept.": {"localizations": {}},"Restart strap…": {"localizations": {}},"Restart this strap?": {"localizations": {}},"Restarted when you recalibrated on %@ — no need to tap it again.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Restarted when you recalibrated on %@ — no need to tap it again."}}}},"Restarts the roughly 4-night build-up for Charge and your HRV baseline from tonight. Use it if a bad first week set your baseline off. Your history stays.": {"localizations": {}},"Resting HR": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Resting HR"}}}},"Resting HR is elevated and HRV is below your baseline, both classic signs of high activation. Prioritise rest, hydration and an easy day.": {"localizations": {}},"Resting HR ↔ Charge": {"localizations": {}},"Resting Heart Rate": {"localizations": {}},"Resting heart rate": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Resting heart rate"}}}},"Resting heart rate and HRV are sitting at or below baseline: low physiological stress. You're in a calm, recovered state.": {"localizations": {}},"Resting heart rate is low and HRV is up. Your nervous system looks well-recovered and calm. A great day to push if you want to.": {"localizations": {}},"Resting heart rate is running high versus your norm. Your body is under load today. Keep effort light.": {"localizations": {}},"Restorative": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Restorative"}}}},"Restorative Sleep": {"localizations": {}},"Restore": {"localizations": {}},"Restore backup %@": {"localizations": {}},"Restore backup from %@": {"localizations": {}},"Restore from a backup…": {"localizations": {}},"Restore problem": {"localizations": {}},"Restore this backup?": {"localizations": {}},"Restore to Today": {"localizations": {}},"Restored": {"localizations": {}},"Resume": {"localizations": {}},"Return to workout": {"localizations": {}},"Reveal in Finder": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Reveal in Finder"}}}},"Reverse the above when you return.": {"localizations": {}},"Reverts to the default profile icon": {"localizations": {}},"Review before sharing": {"localizations": {}},"Reviews each scored wake block for real evidence of getting up (walking cadence, a change in body position) instead of just a heart-rate rise. A wake block with no locomotion and a stable posture — a hot night, a brief turn-over — is folded back into light sleep; a real get-up is left alone. Self-checks how much motion detail your strap actually recorded and stays off on a night that's too sparse to trust (older WHOOP 4.0 firmware, mainly). Off by default; takes effect on the next nights staged.": {"localizations": {}},"Rhythm": {"localizations": {}},"Rhythm only looks during quiet, still, resting windows, so it needs a calm night's worth of steady beats. Once there's a clean window, the scatter and its description show here.": {"localizations": {}},"Rhythm visualization (experimental)": {"localizations": {}},"Right wrist": {"localizations": {}},"Ring key (32 hex characters)": {"localizations": {}},"Ring key, 32 hexadecimal characters": {"localizations": {}},"Rolling RMSSD %lld milliseconds": {"localizations": {}},"Rough": {"localizations": {}},"Rough guide only, based on what you logged.": {"localizations": {}},"Round %lld of %lld": {"localizations": {}},"Rounds": {"localizations": {}},"Route": {"localizations": {}},"Run NOOP actions hands-free.": {"localizations": {}},"Run a Shortcut when put back on": {"localizations": {}},"Run a Shortcut when taken off": {"localizations": {}},"Run a Shortcut…": {"localizations": {}},"Run a clean personal test": {"localizations": {}},"Run down": {"localizations": {}},"Run now": {"localizations": {}},"Running": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Running"}}}},"Runs the continuous HRV stream only during your quiet hours window (22:00–07:00 by default), roughly halving the battery cost. Daytime Stress readings will be sparser. Note: continuous background HRV capture (including daytime naps) is paused outside this window. For on-demand daytime HRV readings (including naps), use the \"Take an HRV reading\" button on the Live screen.": {"localizations": {}},"Runs the stream only during your quiet hours window (22:00 to 07:00 by default), roughly halving the battery cost. Daytime Stress readings will be sparser, since Stress reads this live stream.": {"localizations": {}},"SCORES": {"localizations": {}},"SD1 · ms": {"localizations": {}},"SD1:SD2 ratio": {"localizations": {}},"SD2 · ms": {"localizations": {}},"SEC": {"localizations": {}},"SECONDS": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "SECONDS"}}}},"SENSOR": {"localizations": {}},"SESSION DONE": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "SESSION DONE"}}}},"SESSIONS": {"localizations": {}},"SHORT AXIS": {"localizations": {}},"SIGNIFICANT": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "SIGNIFICANT"}}}},"SILENT GUARDIAN": {"localizations": {}},"SLEEP": {"localizations": {}},"SOURCE": {"localizations": {}},"SPEED": {"localizations": {}},"SPORT": {"localizations": {}},"STEPS ESTIMATE": {"localizations": {}},"STRAP LOG": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "STRAP LOG"}}}},"STREAMING": {"localizations": {}},"STRONGER SIGNAL": {"localizations": {}},"SYNCING %lld": {"localizations": {}},"SYNTHESIS": {"localizations": {}},"Same cardiovascular-load idea as WHOOP's Day Strain (0–21). We rescaled the top of the ladder from 21 to 100 so all three scores share one scale. The rungs didn't move, so a 100 is as rare as a 21.0 was.": {"localizations": {}},"Same core idea as WHOOP's Recovery % (HRV-led recovery), but our weighting and baseline maths are our own, and openly documented.": {"localizations": {}},"Sat": {"localizations": {}},"Saturday": {"localizations": {}},"Save": {"localizations": {}},"Save & Continue": {"localizations": {}},"Save a full backup to a folder you choose - point it at Google Drive, iCloud or Dropbox for off-device sync.": {"localizations": {}},"Save it": {"localizations": {}},"Save key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Save key"}}}},"Save reading": {"localizations": {}},"Save workout": {"localizations": {}},"Saved": {"localizations": {}},"Saved %@ to NOOP's folder in the Files app.": {"localizations": {}},"Saved %@ to your Documents folder.": {"localizations": {}},"Saved a backup to your folder.": {"localizations": {}},"Saved to %@. Copy this file to your other %@ and use Import there to restore everything.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Saved to %1$@. Copy this file to your other %2$@ and use Import there to restore everything."}}}},"Saved to %@. The zip re-imports into NOOP (Data Sources → WHOOP Export) on any Mac, iPhone, or Android device.": {"localizations": {}},"Saves every raw 5/MG frame (with a timestamp and the live heart rate) to a JSON file you can share to help map the biometric layout. This only records frames the strap already sent (it never writes to your strap), so it is safe to leave on. Export the file and attach it to a protocol-mapping issue.": {"localizations": {}},"Saves every raw 5/MG frame (with a timestamp and the live heart rate) to a JSON file you can share to help map the biometric layout. This only records frames the strap already sent, it never writes to your strap, so it is safe to leave on. Export the file and attach it to a protocol-mapping issue.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Saves every raw 5/MG frame (with a timestamp and the live heart rate) to a JSON file you can share to help map the biometric layout. This only records frames the strap already sent, it never writes to your strap, so it is safe to leave on. Export the file and attach it to a protocol-mapping issue."}}}},"Saves the raw capture and the strap log together as a matched pair. Attach both to a protocol-mapping issue.": {"localizations": {}},"Save…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Save…"}}}},"Saving to: %@": {"localizations": {}},"Saving…": {"localizations": {}},"Scan": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Scan"}}}},"Scan & Connect": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Scan & Connect"}}}},"Scan & connect": {"localizations": {}},"Scan connects to %@. To pair or switch bands, open Devices.": {"localizations": {}},"Scan for %@": {"localizations": {}},"Scan for your Oura ring": {"localizations": {}},"Scan for your ring": {"localizations": {}},"Scan with any %@ wallet": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Scan with any %@ wallet"}}}},"Scanning your data…": {"localizations": {}},"Scanning…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Scanning…"}}}},"Scheduled exports cleared": {"localizations": {}},"Scores still calibrating, no single day-owner yet": {"localizations": {}},"Scroll to zoom · drag to pan": {"localizations": {}},"Search": {"localizations": {}},"Search markers": {"localizations": {}},"Search markers (e.g. LDL, ferritin)": {"localizations": {}},"Search sport": {"localizations": {}},"Searching": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Searching"}}}},"Searching…": {"localizations": {}},"See how Charge, Effort and Rest are calculated, and how they differ from WHOOP.": {"localizations": {}},"See recovery, beautifully": {"localizations": {}},"See what shaped your Charge": {"localizations": {}},"See your full readiness": {"localizations": {}},"Self-tracking, not a clinical assessment. If low mood persists, talk to a professional. You deserve support.": {"localizations": {}},"Send": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Send"}}}},"Send a haptic buzz to your WHOOP strap.": {"localizations": {}},"Send enable sequence to strap": {"localizations": {}},"Send probe (read-only)": {"localizations": {}},"Sends the read-only GET_BODY_LOCATION_AND_STATUS (0x54) and shows the strap's full raw reply, decoding the body-location record (revision / location / confidence / status) on WHOOP 4.0. Nothing is written to the strap, and it never changes wear detection or scoring.": {"localizations": {}},"Sep": {"localizations": {}},"Server URL": {"localizations": {}},"Session": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Session"}}}},"Session done": {"localizations": {}},"Session ended. Try a paced breath instead.": {"localizations": {}},"Session live": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Session live"}}}},"Session progress": {"localizations": {}},"Session summary": {"localizations": {}},"Sessions": {"localizations": {}},"Set custom container size": {"localizations": {}},"Set this up on your iPhone": {"localizations": {}},"Set up Apple Watch": {"localizations": {}},"Set which wrist you wear it on…": {"localizations": {}},"Settings": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Settings"}}}},"Settling": {"localizations": {}},"Setup": {"localizations": {}},"Several recovery signals are down. Prioritise rest today.": {"localizations": {}},"Several signals are down at once. Treat today as recovery - easy movement, real sleep tonight.": {"localizations": {}},"Sex": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sex"}}}},"Share": {"localizations": {}},"Share of imported zone time, duration-weighted across sessions (approximate).": {"localizations": {}},"Share of imported zone time, duration-weighted across sessions, approximate.": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Share of imported zone time, duration-weighted across sessions, approximate."}}}},"Sharing %lld bpm. Waiting for a device to pair.": {"localizations": {}},"Shortcut name": {"localizations": {}},"Shortcuts Export": {"localizations": {}},"Shortcuts file export": {"localizations": {}},"Should you push today?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Should you push today?"}}}},"Show %@": {"localizations": {}},"Show %@ donation address": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Show %@ donation address"}}}},"Show & reorder": {"localizations": {}},"Show a Today card reminding you to log your journal": {"localizations": {}},"Show a trend graph beneath each metric.": {"localizations": {}},"Show all metrics": {"localizations": {}},"Show all metrics, %lld more": {"localizations": {}},"Show fewer": {"localizations": {}},"Show fewer metrics": {"localizations": {}},"Show what NOOP is synced from": {"localizations": {}},"Shows a soft sunrise, day, dusk and night scene behind the Today screen. Turn it off for a plain dark canvas. Your cards stay exactly as readable.": {"localizations": {}},"Shows the Apple Health permission sheet": {"localizations": {}},"Shows the advanced settings sections": {"localizations": {}},"Signal Trust": {"localizations": {}},"Signals are down a touch. Keep it easy today.": {"localizations": {}},"Signals up": {"localizations": {}},"Silence-first strap coaching during workouts.": {"localizations": {}},"Silent haptic HIIT, the strap buzzes the transitions": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Silent haptic HIIT, the strap buzzes the transitions"}}}},"Silent haptic HIIT: the strap buzzes the transitions": {"localizations": {}},"Silent strap coaching against today's Charge.": {"localizations": {}},"Similar in spirit to WHOOP's Sleep Performance %; our composite is our own.": {"localizations": {}},"Single": {"localizations": {}},"Single reading in range": {"localizations": {}},"Sip": {"localizations": {}},"Sip %lld ml · Cup %lld ml · Bottle %lld ml": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Sip %1$lld ml · Cup %2$lld ml · Bottle %3$lld ml"}}}},"Siri & Shortcuts": {"localizations": {}},"Sit still and breathe normally. Tap below to take a 60-second reading.": {"localizations": {}},"Sit still and breathe with the buzz. You can stop anytime; a stopped sweep won't lock a pace.": {"localizations": {}},"Sit still, breathe normally. Keep your wrist relaxed and steady.": {"localizations": {}},"Sitting for": {"localizations": {}},"Skin Temp": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Skin Temp"}}}},"Skin Temperature": {"localizations": {}},"Skin temp": {"localizations": {}},"Skin temperature": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Skin temperature"}}}},"Skin temperature %@. %@. Reliable.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new","value": "Skin temperature %1$@. %2$@. Reliable."}}}},"Skin-temperature deviation": {"localizations": {}},"Skin-temperature trend": {"localizations": {}},"Skip alerts when the strap is off your wrist.": {"localizations": {}},"Skip for now": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Skip for now"}}}},"Skip today": {"localizations": {}},"Sky behind cards": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sleep"}}}},"Sleep & Rest": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep / Rest": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep Consistency": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep Debt": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sleep Debt"}}}},"Sleep Efficiency": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep Need": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep Performance": {"extractionState": "stale","localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sleep Performance"}}}},"Sleep Score": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep avg": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep marks": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep performance": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep performance %lld of 100": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep performance %lld of 100, %@": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep quality": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep score": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep scored from how long you slept versus how much you needed, how efficient the night was, and the restorative (deep and REM) share of it.": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep sorting, scores, recording, and where your numbers come from.": {"localizations": {}},"Sleep stage breakdown: deep %lld percent, light %lld percent, REM %lld percent, awake %lld percent": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated","value": "Sleep stage 